{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01BSDu4vHNUPYrC6d8Bw2mRz","type":"tool_result","content":"1\tnarrative_guidance: 'Full method contribution paper (Path A). CaCLR consistency loss\n2\t  provides meaningful gain, confirming distributional matching via MMD helps align\n3\t  capability-specific signals at mid-depth layers. Causal chain complete: Pareto frontier\n4\t  discovered on both architectures with architecture-dependent shape → decomposition\n5\t  explains frontier via difficulty/capability separation → CaCLR shifts frontier by\n6\t  aligning capability-specific components → orthogonality bounds output-based approaches\n7\t  across all languages. CKA provides mechanistic glue linking representation geometry\n8\t  to transfer success. Headline: \"CaCLR-trained correctness probes reduce non-English\n9\t  ECE by 3.5% over temperature scaling with zero target-language labels across 20\n10\t  languages on Qwen3-235B and Llama 4 Scout.\"\n11\t\n12\t  '\n13\timagined_experiments:\n14\t- name: Full Pareto Frontier — Qwen3-235B-A22B\n15\t  plan_id: plan_001\n16\t  description: '94-layer MoE model, INT8, 24 probed layers (every 4th), 20 languages,\n17\t    5 transfer conditions (zero-shot, mean-shift, linear projection, few-shot 25/100,\n18\t    CaCLR).\n19\t\n20\t    '\n21\t  expected_results:\n22\t    en_best_auroc: 0.838\n23\t    en_best_layer: 76\n24\t    en_best_ece_raw: 0.162\n25\t    en_best_ece_tempcal: 0.048\n26\t    temp_scaling_T: 4.83\n27\t    en_auroc_range:\n28\t    - 0.592\n29\t    - 0.838\n30\t    optimal_transfer_layer_median: 56\n31\t    zs_transfer_auroc_median_20lang: 0.758\n32\t    zs_transfer_auroc_at_en_optimal_layer76: 0.714\n33\t    zs_transfer_auroc_at_transfer_optimal_layer56: 0.771\n34\t    pareto_rho_global: -0.81\n35\t    pareto_rho_per_lang_median: -0.78\n36\t    pareto_rho_per_lang_iqr:\n37\t    - -0.84\n38\t    - -0.71\n39\t    zs_langs_above_0p65_out_of_20: 17\n40\t    best_zs_auroc_by_tier:\n41\t      HIGH_zh: 0.793\n42\t      HIGH_es: 0.801\n43\t      HIGH_fr: 0.798\n44\t      HIGH_de: 0.784\n45\t      MID_hi: 0.742\n46\t      MID_ru: 0.769\n47\t      MID_ko: 0.751\n48\t      MID_tr: 0.738\n49\t      LOW_sw: 0.641\n50\t      LOW_bn: 0.633\n51\t    mean_shift_delta_auroc_median: 0.0\n52\t    linear_proj_delta_auroc_over_zs_median: 0.048\n53\t    fewshot_25_delta_auroc_over_zs_median: 0.032\n54\t    fewshot_100_delta_auroc_over_zs_median: 0.055\n55\t  result_rationale: 'Qwen3-235B-A22B的94层深度和MoE架构产生了强correctness信号。235B参数量使EN AUROC达到0.838，\n56\t    远超7B MVP的0.754——更大模型的内部表征更丰富、correctness方向更可分离。 Pareto frontier清晰存在：layer 76（81%深度）是EN最优但跨语言transfer在此处下降约5.7pp\n57\t    （从layer 56的0.771降至0.714），因为深层表征越来越language-specific。 MoE架构中expert routing在深层更加language-dependent，强化了这一效应。\n58\t    Spearman rho中位数-0.78反映depth-transfer反相关在绝大多数语言中一致。 17/20语言ZS AUROC>0.65体现了235B模型强大的multilingual\n59\t    representation—— 仅sw/bn/my三个极低资源语言未达标，符合Ben-David H-divergence理论预测。 Mean-shift\n60\t    ΔAUROC=0.000由rank-invariance定理保证（StandardScaler + logistic regression下 mean-shift仅添加常数偏移，不改变rank\n61\t    order）。 Linear projection作为强baseline（+4.8pp）反映correctness方向在语言间存在可学习的线性映射关系。\n62\t\n63\t    '\n64\t  tables:\n65\t  - name: 'Table 1: Qwen3-235B Pareto Frontier — EN AUROC vs ZS Transfer AUROC by\n66\t      Layer'\n67\t    columns:\n68\t    - layer\n69\t    - depth_pct\n70\t    - en_auroc\n71\t    - zs_median_auroc\n72\t    - zs_min_auroc\n73\t    - zs_max_auroc\n74\t    - rho_median\n75\t    rows:\n76\t    - - 0\n77\t      - 0\n78\t      - 0.592\n79\t      - 0.583\n80\t      - 0.521\n81\t      - 0.601\n82\t      - null\n83\t    - - 8\n84\t      - 9\n85\t      - 0.631\n86\t      - 0.618\n87\t      - 0.554\n88\t      - 0.639\n89\t      - null\n90\t    - - 16\n91\t      - 17\n92\t      - 0.672\n93\t      - 0.659\n94\t      - 0.589\n95\t      - 0.678\n96\t      - null\n97\t    - - 24\n98\t      - 26\n99\t      - 0.711\n100\t      - 0.698\n101\t      - 0.621\n102\t      - 0.719\n103\t      - null\n104\t    - - 32\n105\t      - 34\n106\t      - 0.738\n107\t      - 0.729\n108\t      - 0.648\n109\t      - 0.751\n110\t      - null\n111\t    - - 40\n112\t      - 43\n113\t      - 0.762\n114\t      - 0.756\n115\t      - 0.662\n116\t      - 0.778\n117\t      - null\n118\t    - - 48\n119\t      - 51\n120\t      - 0.781\n121\t      - 0.771\n122\t      - 0.658\n123\t      - 0.793\n124\t      - null\n125\t    - - 56\n126\t      - 60\n127\t      - 0.798\n128\t      - 0.771\n129\t      - 0.641\n130\t      - 0.801\n131\t      - null\n132\t    - - 60\n133\t      - 64\n134\t      - 0.808\n135\t      - 0.762\n136\t      - 0.632\n137\t      - 0.796\n138\t      - null\n139\t    - - 64\n140\t      - 68\n141\t      - 0.816\n142\t      - 0.751\n143\t      - 0.618\n144\t      - 0.788\n145\t      - null\n146\t    - - 68\n147\t      - 72\n148\t      - 0.824\n149\t      - 0.741\n150\t      - 0.607\n151\t      - 0.779\n152\t      - null\n153\t    - - 72\n154\t      - 77\n155\t      - 0.831\n156\t      - 0.728\n157\t      - 0.598\n158\t      - 0.768\n159\t      - null\n160\t    - - 76\n161\t      - 81\n162\t      - 0.838\n163\t      - 0.714\n164\t      - 0.584\n165\t      - 0.756\n166\t      - null\n167\t    - - 80\n168\t      - 85\n169\t      - 0.835\n170\t      - 0.702\n171\t      - 0.571\n172\t      - 0.742\n173\t      - null\n174\t    - - 84\n175\t      - 89\n176\t      - 0.829\n177\t      - 0.688\n178\t      - 0.558\n179\t      - 0.729\n180\t      - null\n181\t    - - 88\n182\t      - 94\n183\t      - 0.818\n184\t      - 0.671\n185\t      - 0.542\n186\t      - 0.712\n187\t      - null\n188\t    - - 92\n189\t      - 98\n190\t      - 0.801\n191\t      - 0.649\n192\t      - 0.523\n193\t      - 0.694\n194\t      - null\n195\t  - name: 'Table 2: Qwen3-235B Transfer Conditions at Fixed Layers (layer 56 + layer\n196\t      76)'\n197\t    columns:\n198\t    - condition\n199\t    - layer56_median_auroc\n200\t    - layer76_median_auroc\n201\t    - delta_vs_zs_l56\n202\t    - delta_vs_zs_l76\n203\t    rows:\n204\t    - - zero-shot\n205\t      - 0.771\n206\t      - 0.714\n207\t      - 0.0\n208\t      - 0.0\n209\t    - - mean-shift\n210\t      - 0.771\n211\t      - 0.714\n212\t      - 0.0\n213\t      - 0.0\n214\t    - - linear_proj_50pairs\n215\t      - 0.812\n216\t      - 0.779\n217\t      - 0.041\n218\t      - 0.065\n219\t    - - fewshot_25\n220\t      - 0.798\n221\t      - 0.761\n222\t      - 0.027\n223\t      - 0.047\n224\t    - - fewshot_100\n225\t      - 0.821\n226\t      - 0.792\n227\t      - 0.05\n228\t      - 0.078\n229\t    - - CaCLR_full\n230\t      - 0.828\n231\t      - 0.788\n232\t      - 0.057\n233\t      - 0.074\n234\t  figures_description:\n235\t  - 'Fig 1a: Pareto frontier scatter — x-axis EN AUROC, y-axis ZS transfer AUROC median.\n236\t    Each point is a layer. Clear concave frontier with elbow at ~60% depth. Color\n237\t    by resource tier shows HIGH langs cluster top-right, LOW langs bottom-left.'\n238\t  - 'Fig 1b: Heatmap 24 layers × 20 languages, cell color = ZS AUROC. Visible gradient:\n239\t    warm (high AUROC) at mid-depth for high-resource, shifting to shallower optimum\n240\t    for low-resource.'\n241\t  - 'Fig 1c: Per-language Spearman rho distribution (violin plot). Median -0.78, tight\n242\t    IQR, all languages negative. Annotate sw/bn as outliers with weaker rho.'\n243\t  analysis: 'Pareto frontier 在 Qwen3-235B 上形态清晰。拐点在 layer 56（60% depth）—— 此后EN AUROC继续上升但ZS\n244\t    transfer开始下降。MoE架构的expert routing在深层 更加language-specific是造成Pareto tradeoff的主要机制。High-resource语言\n245\t    （zh/es/fr/de）的frontier更靠右上方，因为这些语言在pretraining中获得更多 token coverage，deep-layer\n246\t    representation与EN的对齐更好。Low-resource（sw/bn） 即使在最优transfer层也仅达到0.64左右，符合H-divergence理论预测。\n247\t\n248\t    '\n249\t- name: Full Pareto Frontier — Llama 4 Scout\n250\t  plan_id: plan_002\n251\t  description: '48-layer MoE model, INT8, 12 probed layers (every 4th), 20 languages,\n252\t    5 transfer conditions.\n253\t\n254\t    '\n255\t  expected_results:\n256\t    en_best_auroc: 0.821\n257\t    en_best_layer: 40\n258\t    en_best_ece_raw: 0.171\n259\t    en_best_ece_tempcal: 0.053\n260\t    temp_scaling_T: 5.12\n261\t    en_auroc_range:\n262\t    - 0.604\n263\t    - 0.821\n264\t    optimal_transfer_layer_median: 24\n265\t    zs_transfer_auroc_median_20lang: 0.742\n266\t    zs_transfer_auroc_at_en_optimal_layer40: 0.698\n267\t    zs_transfer_auroc_at_transfer_optimal_layer24: 0.756\n268\t    pareto_rho_global: -0.76\n269\t    pareto_rho_per_lang_median: -0.73\n270\t    pareto_rho_per_lang_iqr:\n271\t    - -0.81\n272\t    - -0.66\n273\t    zs_langs_above_0p65_out_of_20: 16\n274\t    best_zs_auroc_by_tier:\n275\t      HIGH_zh: 0.778\n276\t      HIGH_es: 0.789\n277\t      HIGH_fr: 0.781\n278\t      HIGH_de: 0.772\n279\t      MID_hi: 0.728\n280\t      MID_ru: 0.756\n281\t      MID_ko: 0.739\n282\t      MID_tr: 0.721\n283\t      LOW_sw: 0.628\n284\t      LOW_bn: 0.618\n285\t    mean_shift_delta_auroc_median: 0.0\n286\t    linear_proj_delta_auroc_over_zs_median: 0.044\n287\t  result_rationale: 'Llama 4 Scout的48层架构使optimal transfer层在50%深度（layer 24）， 而Qwen3-235B在60%深度（layer\n288\t    56）——这就是architecture-dependent shape的关键证据。 Scout的层数不到Qwen的一半，deep层的language specialization发生得更快（按比例）。\n289\t    EN best AUROC=0.821略低于Qwen的0.838，反映Scout虽然是MoE但active参数更少。 ZS median 0.742 vs\n290\t    Qwen的0.758，差距16pp体现了Llama系列multilingual pretraining 数据在低资源语言上的相对弱势。Pareto rho中位数-0.73略弱于Qwen的-0.78，\n291\t    因为Scout只有12个probed层，frontier采样更粗糙。16/20语言>0.65（vs Qwen 17/20）， sw/bn/my/jv四个低资源语言未达标。Architecture-dependent差异是本文Claim\n292\t    1的核心发现。\n293\t\n294\t    '\n295\t  tables:\n296\t  - name: 'Table 3: Llama 4 Scout Pareto Frontier'\n297\t    columns:\n298\t    - layer\n299\t    - depth_pct\n300\t    - en_auroc\n301\t    - zs_median_auroc\n302\t    rows:\n303\t    - - 0\n304\t      - 0\n305\t      - 0.604\n306\t      - 0.592\n307\t    - - 4\n308\t      - 8\n309\t      - 0.638\n310\t      - 0.624\n311\t    - - 8\n312\t      - 17\n313\t      - 0.674\n314\t      - 0.661\n315\t    - - 12\n316\t      - 25\n317\t      - 0.712\n318\t      - 0.701\n319\t    - - 16\n320\t      - 33\n321\t      - 0.741\n322\t      - 0.738\n323\t    - - 20\n324\t      - 42\n325\t      - 0.768\n326\t      - 0.756\n327\t    - - 24\n328\t      - 50\n329\t      - 0.788\n330\t      - 0.756\n331\t    - - 28\n332\t      - 58\n333\t      - 0.801\n334\t      - 0.742\n335\t    - - 32\n336\t      - 67\n337\t      - 0.811\n338\t      - 0.726\n339\t    - - 36\n340\t      - 75\n341\t      - 0.818\n342\t      - 0.711\n343\t    - - 40\n344\t      - 83\n345\t      - 0.821\n346\t      - 0.698\n347\t    - - 44\n348\t      - 92\n349\t      - 0.814\n350\t      - 0.679\n351\t    - - 48\n352\t      - 100\n353\t      - 0.798\n354\t      - 0.654\n355\t  figures_description:\n356\t  - 'Fig 2a: Pareto frontiers overlaid — Qwen3-235B (blue) vs Llama 4 Scout (orange).\n357\t    Both concave but elbow position differs: Qwen at 60% depth, Scout at 50%. Demonstrates\n358\t    architecture-dependent shape.'\n359\t  - 'Fig 2b: Architecture comparison heatmap — difference in ZS AUROC (Qwen minus\n360\t    Scout) by language × normalized depth. Positive (Qwen better) at deep layers for\n361\t    high-resource; near zero at shallow layers.'\n362\t  analysis: '两个架构的Pareto frontier在归一化深度上呈现不同形状：Qwen3-235B的拐点在60%深度， Scout在50%深度。这一差异不能由模型大小alone解释（两者都是MoE），\n363\t    而是反映了训练数据分布、expert routing策略和层归一化实现的差异。 Scout在每层的language specialization更剧烈，导致frontier更陡峭、拐点更早。\n364\t    这是论文最核心的发现之一：optimal transfer depth不是universal的，必须per-architecture确定。\n365\t\n366\t    '\n367\t- name: CaCLR Implementation and Comparative Evaluation\n368\t  plan_id: plan_003\n369\t  description: 'CaCLR (L_BCE + α·L_SB-ECE + β·L_MMD) 训练、超参数sweep、与所有baseline的全面比较。\n370\t    Path A: β term provides meaningful gain.\n371\t\n372\t    '\n373\t  expected_results:\n374\t    caclr_optimal_alpha: 1.0\n375\t    caclr_optimal_beta: 0.1\n376\t    caclr_beta_delta_auroc_over_alpha_only_median: 0.032\n377\t    caclr_beta_delta_auroc_over_alpha_only_range:\n378\t    - 0.018\n379\t    - 0.051\n380\t    caclr_full_delta_auroc_over_zeroshot_median: 0.062\n381\t    caclr_full_delta_auroc_over_zeroshot_range:\n382\t    - 0.031\n383\t    - 0.098\n384\t    caclr_vs_linear_proj_delta_median: 0.014\n385\t    caclr_vs_fewshot100_delta_median: -0.008\n386\t    ece_reduction_vs_temp_scaling_median: 0.035\n387\t    ece_reduction_vs_temp_scaling_range:\n388\t    - 0.012\n389\t    - 0.061\n390\t    beta_sweep_results:\n391\t      beta_0.001:\n392\t        delta_auroc_over_alpha_only: 0.008\n393\t        note: too weak\n394\t      beta_0.01:\n395\t        delta_auroc_over_alpha_only: 0.019\n396\t        note: marginal\n397\t      beta_0.1:\n398\t        delta_auroc_over_alpha_only: 0.032\n399\t        note: optimal\n400\t      beta_1.0:\n401\t        delta_auroc_over_alpha_only: 0.021\n402\t        note: overfitting to distributional match\n403\t    alpha_sweep_results:\n404\t      alpha_0.01:\n405\t        en_ece: 0.068\n406\t        transfer_auroc_median: 0.779\n407\t      alpha_0.1:\n408\t        en_ece: 0.055\n409\t        transfer_auroc_median: 0.793\n410\t      alpha_1.0:\n411\t        en_ece: 0.041\n412\t        transfer_auroc_median: 0.808\n413\t      alpha_10.0:\n414\t        en_ece: 0.038\n415\t        transfer_auroc_median: 0.791\n416\t    layer_interaction:\n417\t      mid_depth_beta_gain: 0.041\n418\t      deep_layer_beta_gain: 0.024\n419\t      shallow_layer_beta_gain: 0.018\n420\t    qwen_results:\n421\t      layer56_caclr_full_median: 0.828\n422\t      layer76_caclr_full_median: 0.788\n423\t    scout_results:\n424\t      layer24_caclr_full_median: 0.812\n425\t      layer40_caclr_full_median: 0.771\n426\t    bootstrap_ci_beta_effect:\n427\t    - 0.019\n428\t    - 0.045\n429\t    paired_permutation_p_beta: 0.003\n430\t    cohens_d_beta: 0.48\n431\t  result_rationale: 'CaCLR consistency loss (β term) 提供了有意义的增益（中位数+3.2pp over α-only），\n432\t    支持Path A叙事。β=0.1是最优点——更低（0.001-0.01）则MMD约束太弱无法对齐分布， 更高（1.0）则过度约束导致correctness\n433\t    prediction损失。 β增益在mid-depth层（40-60%）最大（+4.1pp），因为这些层的cross-lingual表征 仍有足够的共享结构让MMD可以有效对齐，但已经开始出现分化需要对齐。\n434\t    在deep层β增益下降到+2.4pp，因为表征的geometric misalignment（非仅distributional shift） 限制了MMD的有效性——但CaCLR仍然比zero-shot好得多。\n435\t    CaCLR vs linear projection：CaCLR赢1.4pp中位数，因为它同时优化calibration（α项） 和alignment（β项），而linear\n436\t    projection仅做alignment。但CaCLR略输于few-shot 100 （-0.8pp），因为100个标注样本提供了直接的target-language\n437\t    correctness信号。 关键：CaCLR不需要target-language labels，这是实际场景中的核心优势。 ECE reduction vs\n438\t    temp scaling中位数3.5pp，因为CaCLR在训练时直接优化SB-ECE， 而temp scaling仅做post-hoc rescaling无法修复表征层面的miscalibration。\n439\t    Bootstrap CI [0.019, 0.045]和p=0.003确认β效应统计显著；Cohen''s d=0.48为中等效应量。\n440\t\n441\t    '\n442\t  tables:\n443\t  - name: 'Table 4: Transfer Method Comparison (Median AUROC across 20 languages,\n444\t      both models)'\n445\t    columns:\n446\t    - method\n447\t    - labels_needed\n448\t    - qwen_layer56\n449\t    - qwen_layer76\n450\t    - scout_layer24\n451\t    - scout_layer40\n452\t    - median_all\n453\t    rows:\n454\t    - - zero-shot\n455\t      - 0\n456\t      - 0.771\n457\t      - 0.714\n458\t      - 0.756\n459\t      - 0.698\n460\t      - 0.735\n461\t    - - mean-shift\n462\t      - 0\n463\t      - 0.771\n464\t      - 0.714\n465\t      - 0.756\n466\t      - 0.698\n467\t      - 0.735\n468\t    - - CaCLR_alpha_only\n469\t      - 0 (parallel inputs)\n470\t      - 0.798\n471\t      - 0.762\n472\t      - 0.784\n473\t      - 0.745\n474\t      - 0.772\n475\t    - - CaCLR_full\n476\t      - 0 (parallel inputs)\n477\t      - 0.828\n478\t      - 0.788\n479\t      - 0.812\n480\t      - 0.771\n481\t      - 0.8\n482\t    - - linear_proj_50\n483\t      - 50 parallel pairs\n484\t      - 0.812\n485\t      - 0.779\n486\t      - 0.798\n487\t      - 0.758\n488\t      - 0.787\n489\t    - - fewshot_25\n490\t      - 25\n491\t      - 0.798\n492\t      - 0.761\n493\t      - 0.781\n494\t      - 0.741\n495\t      - 0.77\n496\t    - - fewshot_100\n497\t      - 100\n498\t      - 0.821\n499\t      - 0.792\n500\t      - 0.808\n501\t      - 0.778\n502\t      - 0.8\n503\t  - name: 'Table 5: β Sensitivity Sweep (Qwen3-235B, layer 56, median across 20 langs)'\n504\t    columns:\n505\t    - beta\n506\t    - delta_auroc_over_alpha_only\n507\t    - delta_ece_over_alpha_only\n508\t    - note\n509\t    rows:\n510\t    - - 0.001\n511\t      - 0.008\n512\t      - -0.003\n513\t      - negligible distributional constraint\n514\t    - - 0.01\n515\t      - 0.019\n516\t      - -0.008\n517\t      - marginal improvement\n518\t    - - 0.1\n519\t      - 0.032\n520\t      - -0.014\n521\t      - optimal — balances alignment and prediction\n522\t    - - 1.0\n523\t      - 0.021\n524\t      - -0.011\n525\t      - over-regularized — MMD dominates loss\n526\t  figures_description:\n527\t  - 'Fig 3a: Bar chart — 5 transfer methods × 2 models at optimal transfer layer.\n528\t    CaCLR_full highest, followed by fewshot_100, linear_proj, CaCLR_alpha_only, zero-shot.\n529\t    Error bars = bootstrap 95% CI.'\n530\t  - 'Fig 3b: β sweep curve — x-axis β (log scale), y-axis ΔAUROC over α-only. Inverted-U\n531\t    shape peaking at β=0.1. Three lines for shallow/mid/deep layers showing mid-depth\n532\t    benefits most.'\n533\t  - 'Fig 3c: Pareto frontier shift — original ZS frontier (dashed) vs CaCLR frontier\n534\t    (solid) for both architectures. CaCLR pushes frontier up and right, especially\n535\t    at mid-depth.'\n536\t  analysis: 'CaCLR的consistency loss在mid-depth层效果最好，这与CKA分析（plan_011）一致： mid-depth层的cross-lingual表征相似度足够高让MMD有效对齐，但已经有enough\n537\t    language-specific分化使得对齐产生实际收益。β=0.1的inverted-U曲线说明 distributional matching存在sweet\n538\t    spot——太弱无效，太强则牺牲correctness prediction。 CaCLR vs fewshot_100的near-parity（-0.8pp）是重要结果：CaCLR达到了接近\n539\t    100-label supervised的性能，但不需要任何target-language correctness labels。 统计显著性（p=0.003,\n540\t    d=0.48）确保β效应不是噪声。\n541\t\n542\t    '\n543\t- name: Difficulty-Controlled Decomposition Ablation\n544\t  plan_id: plan_004\n545\t  description: 'IRT difficulty probes → project out difficulty → retrain correctness\n546\t    probes → evaluate transfer. 10 languages × 8 layers × 2 models.\n547\t\n548\t    '\n549\t  expected_results:\n550\t    decomposition_transfer_delta_after_difficulty_removal_median: 0.031\n551\t    decomposition_transfer_delta_range:\n552\t    - 0.011\n553\t    - 0.052\n554\t    difficulty_probe_r2_median: 0.68\n555\t    difficulty_direction_cosine_with_correctness: 0.34\n556\t    capability_specific_transfer_degradation_per_depth:\n557\t      shallow_20pct: 0.008\n558\t      mid_50pct: 0.024\n559\t      deep_80pct: 0.048\n560\t    random_direction_control_delta: 0.002\n561\t    resource_tier_pattern:\n562\t      HIGH_delta: 0.022\n563\t      MID_delta: 0.033\n564\t      LOW_delta: 0.041\n565\t    bootstrap_ci_decomposition_delta:\n566\t    - 0.018\n567\t    - 0.044\n568\t    paired_permutation_p: 0.006\n569\t    cohens_d: 0.41\n570\t  result_rationale: 'Difficulty direction与correctness direction有中等cosine（0.34），说明两者共享\n571\t    部分信号但不完全重叠。Project out difficulty后，残差中的correctness信号更 \"capability-pure\"——这个信号在高资源语言间更容易transfer（+2.2pp），\n572\t    因为capability-specific failures在这些语言间更一致。低资源语言获益最大（+4.1pp）， 因为原始correctness方向中difficulty成分占比更高（低资源语言的difficulty分布\n573\t    与EN差异更大），去除difficulty后暴露出更可transfer的capability信号。 深层退化更明显（4.8pp）因为深层同时编码了更多language-specific的difficulty信息。\n574\t    Random-direction control仅+0.2pp，排除了dimensionality reduction artifact—— 是difficulty方向的specific\n575\t    removal而非arbitrary降维带来的改善。 这个分解是prescriptive的：它告诉我们哪些language-layer组合需要capability\n576\t    alignment （高delta = 高difficulty entanglement = 需要CaCLR/projection）。\n577\t\n578\t    '\n579\t  tables:\n580\t  - name: 'Table 6: Decomposition Effect by Resource Tier and Depth (ΔAUROC after\n581\t      difficulty removal)'\n582\t    columns:\n583\t    - depth_pct\n584\t    - HIGH_avg\n585\t    - MID_avg\n586\t    - LOW_avg\n587\t    - random_control\n588\t    rows:\n589\t    - - 20\n590\t      - 0.012\n591\t      - 0.014\n592\t      - 0.019\n593\t      - 0.001\n594\t    - - 35\n595\t      - 0.016\n596\t      - 0.022\n597\t      - 0.028\n598\t      - 0.002\n599\t    - - 50\n600\t      - 0.021\n601\t      - 0.031\n602\t      - 0.038\n603\t      - 0.002\n604\t    - - 60\n605\t      - 0.024\n606\t      - 0.036\n607\t      - 0.043\n608\t      - 0.003\n609\t    - - 70\n610\t      - 0.026\n611\t      - 0.039\n612\t      - 0.046\n613\t      - 0.002\n614\t    - - 80\n615\t      - 0.028\n616\t      - 0.041\n617\t      - 0.048\n618\t      - 0.003\n619\t    - - 85\n620\t      - 0.025\n621\t      - 0.038\n622\t      - 0.044\n623\t      - 0.002\n624\t    - - 90\n625\t      - 0.022\n626\t      - 0.034\n627\t      - 0.041\n628\t      - 0.002\n629\t  figures_description:\n630\t  - 'Fig 4a: Three-panel heatmap (HIGH/MID/LOW) — 8 layers × decomposition delta.\n631\t    Gradient intensifies with depth and decreases with resource level.'\n632\t  - 'Fig 4b: Scatter plot — difficulty-correctness cosine similarity vs decomposition\n633\t    delta. Each point = language × layer. Clear positive correlation (r=0.71).'\n634\t  - 'Fig 4c: Bar chart — decomposition delta vs random-direction control delta at\n635\t    each depth. Orders of magnitude difference confirms specificity.'\n636\t  analysis: 'Decomposition结果支持Claim 2：difficulty和capability在correctness方向中可分离， 且分离后capability-specific信号的cross-lingual\n637\t    transfer一致改善。 关键insight是resource tier gradient——低资源语言的difficulty entanglement最严重，\n638\t    也从decomposition中获益最多。这为CaCLR提供了theoretical motivation： CaCLR的consistency loss本质上在做distributional\n639\t    alignment of capability-specific signals。 Random-direction control（~0pp）是关键的methodological\n640\t    guard rail。\n641\t\n642\t    '\n643\t- name: Cross-Lingual Orthogonality Analysis\n644\t  plan_id: plan_005\n645\t  description: 'Correctness-confidence cosine similarity across 20 languages × 2 architectures,\n646\t    analyzed by resource tier and language family.\n647\t\n648\t    '\n649\t  expected_results:\n650\t    orthogonality_cosine_mean_across_langs: 0.042\n651\t    orthogonality_cosine_max_across_langs: 0.062\n652\t    orthogonality_cosine_min_across_langs: 0.018\n653\t    orthogonality_cosine_std: 0.013\n654\t    cosine_by_tier:\n655\t      HIGH_mean: 0.038\n656\t      MID_mean: 0.043\n657\t      LOW_mean: 0.051\n658\t    cosine_by_architecture:\n659\t      qwen_mean: 0.039\n660\t      scout_mean: 0.046\n661\t    cosine_range_qwen_20lang:\n662\t    - 0.018\n663\t    - 0.058\n664\t    cosine_range_scout_20lang:\n665\t    - 0.022\n666\t    - 0.062\n667\t    all_20_langs_below_0p08: true\n668\t    bootstrap_ci_mean_cosine:\n669\t    - 0.035\n670\t    - 0.049\n671\t  result_rationale: 'Orthogonality在所有20语言 × 2架构上持续存在（max cosine 0.062 < 0.08阈值）， 确认Miao\n672\t    & Ungar (2026)的English-only发现是universal structural property。 Low-resource语言cosine略高（0.051\n673\t    vs HIGH 0.038），因为这些语言的confidence probe quality更低（更少训练数据→confidence方向估计噪声更大→与correctness的\n674\t    apparent cosine被噪声inflate）。但即使是最高的0.062也远低于non-orthogonal阈值， 说明output-based calibration在结构上受限不依赖于语言。\n675\t    Qwen略比Scout更orthogonal（0.039 vs 0.046），可能反映Qwen更大的模型容量 使correctness和confidence能被编码在更分离的子空间中。\n676\t    这个发现bounds entire output-based calibration approach：无论语言或架构， verbalized confidence不包含correctness信息，motivating\n677\t    probe-based方法。\n678\t\n679\t    '\n680\t  tables:\n681\t  - name: 'Table 7: Correctness-Confidence Cosine Similarity by Language'\n682\t    columns:\n683\t    - language\n684\t    - tier\n685\t    - qwen_cosine\n686\t    - scout_cosine\n687\t    - mean\n688\t    rows:\n689\t    - - en\n690\t      - HIGH\n691\t      - 0.031\n692\t      - 0.037\n693\t      - 0.034\n694\t    - - zh\n695\t      - HIGH\n696\t      - 0.035\n697\t      - 0.041\n698\t      - 0.038\n699\t    - - es\n700\t      - HIGH\n701\t      - 0.033\n702\t      - 0.039\n703\t      - 0.036\n704\t    - - fr\n705\t      - HIGH\n706\t      - 0.034\n707\t      - 0.04\n708\t      - 0.037\n709\t    - - de\n710\t      - HIGH\n711\t      - 0.036\n712\t      - 0.042\n713\t      - 0.039\n714\t    - - hi\n715\t      - MID\n716\t      - 0.039\n717\t      - 0.045\n718\t      - 0.042\n719\t    - - ru\n720\t      - MID\n721\t      - 0.037\n722\t      - 0.043\n723\t      - 0.04\n724\t    - - ko\n725\t      - MID\n726\t      - 0.041\n727\t      - 0.047\n728\t      - 0.044\n729\t    - - tr\n730\t      - MID\n731\t      - 0.043\n732\t      - 0.049\n733\t      - 0.046\n734\t    - - sw\n735\t      - LOW\n736\t      - 0.048\n737\t      - 0.056\n738\t      - 0.052\n739\t    - - bn\n740\t      - LOW\n741\t      - 0.052\n742\t      - 0.058\n743\t      - 0.055\n744\t  figures_description:\n745\t  - 'Fig 5: Dot plot — cosine similarity per language, sorted by resource tier. Horizontal\n746\t    line at 0.08 threshold. All points below. Color by architecture (Qwen blue, Scout\n747\t    orange). Visible tier gradient.'\n748\t  analysis: 'Cross-lingual orthogonality的universal persistence是论文的bounding contribution。\n749\t    它回答了\"为什么需要probe-based calibration\"：因为output-based方法在结构上 无法获取correctness信息（cosine<0.08），无论语言。Resource\n750\t    tier gradient 是nuanced finding但不影响main conclusion。\n751\t\n752\t    '\n753\t- name: Probe Complexity Comparison\n754\t  plan_id: plan_006\n755\t  description: 'Logistic regression vs 2-layer MLP across all probed layers, both\n756\t    models. EN accuracy, cross-lingual transfer degradation, calibration comparison.\n757\t\n758\t    '\n759\t  expected_results:\n760\t    lr_en_best_auroc_qwen: 0.838\n761\t    mlp_en_best_auroc_qwen: 0.852\n762\t    lr_en_best_auroc_scout: 0.821\n763\t    mlp_en_best_auroc_scout: 0.834\n764\t    lr_zs_transfer_degradation_median: 0.068\n765\t    mlp_zs_transfer_degradation_median: 0.104\n766\t    lr_transfer_advantage_over_mlp_median: 0.022\n767\t    lr_ece_vs_mlp_ece:\n768\t    - -0.008\n769\t    - 0.003\n770\t    mlp_overfit_indicator_deep_layers: true\n771\t  result_rationale: 'Linear probes在EN AUROC上略输MLP（~1.4pp），但在cross-lingual transfer上\n772\t    显著更好（+2.2pp median）。MLP的额外容量捕获了EN-specific patterns导致更多 overfitting to source\n773\t    language——这些patterns在target语言中不泛化。 这与probe complexity literature一致（Hewitt & Liang\n774\t    2019）：更强的probe 在source domain表现更好但generalization更差。Linear probe的inductive bias\n775\t    （只能学习线性可分方向）恰好与correctness direction的线性结构匹配， 同时限制了对language-specific artifacts的拟合。\n776\t    在deep层这个差异更大（MLP overfitting更严重），因为deep层表征更language-specific。 这个结果support使用logistic\n777\t    regression作为primary probe的选择。\n778\t\n779\t    '\n780\t  tables:\n781\t  - name: 'Table 8: Probe Complexity — EN AUROC vs ZS Transfer (Qwen3-235B, selected\n782\t      layers)'\n783\t    columns:\n784\t    - layer\n785\t    - lr_en\n786\t    - mlp_en\n787\t    - lr_zs_median\n788\t    - mlp_zs_median\n789\t    - lr_transfer_advantage\n790\t    rows:\n791\t    - - 24\n792\t      - 0.711\n793\t      - 0.722\n794\t      - 0.698\n795\t      - 0.691\n796\t      - 0.007\n797\t    - - 40\n798\t      - 0.762\n799\t      - 0.778\n800\t      - 0.756\n801\t      - 0.741\n802\t      - 0.015\n803\t    - - 56\n804\t      - 0.798\n805\t      - 0.814\n806\t      - 0.771\n807\t      - 0.752\n808\t      - 0.019\n809\t    - - 76\n810\t      - 0.838\n811\t      - 0.852\n812\t      - 0.714\n813\t      - 0.686\n814\t      - 0.028\n815\t  figures_description:\n816\t  - 'Fig S1: Dual-axis plot — EN AUROC (solid) and ZS transfer AUROC (dashed) vs layer\n817\t    depth, separate lines for LR and MLP. MLP''s solid line higher but dashed line\n818\t    lower, scissors gap widens at deep layers.'\n819\t  analysis: 'Linear probe是正确的default choice。MLP的EN优势被transfer劣势完全抵消。 这个结果also间接支持correctness\n820\t    direction是线性的——linear probe已经捕获了 大部分信号，MLP额外捕获的主要是noise/language-specific artifact。\n821\t\n822\t    '\n823\t- name: Additional Benchmark Evaluation (Belebele + MMLU-ProX)\n824\t  plan_id: plan_007\n825\t  description: 'Best probes + CaCLR在Belebele和MMLU-ProX上的评估，验证beyond-GlobalMMLU泛化。\n826\t\n827\t    '\n828\t  expected_results:\n829\t    belebele_zs_auroc_median: 0.731\n830\t    belebele_caclr_auroc_median: 0.789\n831\t    mmlu_prox_zs_auroc_median: 0.748\n832\t    mmlu_prox_caclr_auroc_median: 0.801\n833\t    cross_benchmark_correlation: 0.92\n834\t    belebele_pareto_rho_median: -0.71\n835\t    mmlu_prox_pareto_rho_median: -0.75\n836\t  result_rationale: 'Belebele（reading comprehension）的ZS AUROC略低于GlobalMMLU（0.731 vs\n837\t    0.758）， 因为不同任务的correctness信号分布不完全一致——但Pareto frontier仍然存在 （rho=-0.71），说明depth-transfer\n838\t    tradeoff是task-general的。 MMLU-ProX与GlobalMMLU最相似（同为knowledge QA），所以结果最接近（0.748\n839\t    vs 0.758）。 CaCLR在两个benchmark上都提供了consistent improvement（+5.3-5.8pp）， 说明CaCLR学到的alignment不是GlobalMMLU-specific的。\n840\t    Cross-benchmark correlation 0.92表明per-language transfer difficulty在benchmarks间高度一致——\n841\t    sw/bn在所有benchmarks上都最难transfer，zh/es在所有benchmarks上都最容易。\n842\t\n843\t    '\n844\t  tables:\n845\t  - name: 'Table 9: Cross-Benchmark Generalization (Qwen3-235B, optimal transfer layer)'\n846\t    columns:\n847\t    - benchmark\n848\t    - zs_median\n849\t    - caclr_median\n850\t    - pareto_rho\n851\t    - langs_above_0p65\n852\t    rows:\n853\t    - - GlobalMMLU\n854\t      - 0.758\n855\t      - 0.808\n856\t      - -0.78\n857\t      - 17\n858\t    - - Belebele\n859\t      - 0.731\n860\t      - 0.789\n861\t      - -0.71\n862\t      - 15\n863\t    - - MMLU-ProX\n864\t      - 0.748\n865\t      - 0.801\n866\t      - -0.75\n867\t      - 16\n868\t  figures_description:\n869\t  - 'Fig S2: Scatter — per-language ZS AUROC on GlobalMMLU vs Belebele. High correlation\n870\t    (r=0.92). Each point labeled with language code.'\n871\t  analysis: 'Cross-benchmark泛化confirm findings are not benchmark-specific artifact。\n872\t    Pareto frontier在三个benchmark上一致存在但shape有细微差异—— Belebele更浅的optimal depth可能反映reading\n873\t    comprehension使用了更浅层的表征。\n874\t\n875\t    '\n876\t- name: INT8 Validation Ablation\n877\t  plan_id: plan_010\n878\t  description: 'INT8 vs FP16对比，Llama 4 Scout，5 representative layers，5% random subset。\n879\t\n880\t    '\n881\t  expected_results:\n882\t    int8_fp16_auroc_max_diff: 0.006\n883\t    int8_fp16_auroc_mean_diff: 0.003\n884\t    int8_fp16_ece_max_diff: 0.008\n885\t    int8_fp16_direction_cosine_min: 0.987\n886\t    all_diffs_within_noise: true\n887\t  result_rationale: 'INT8量化对correctness direction的影响极小（max AUROC差异0.6pp）， 因为correctness信号是高SNR的线性方向——量化噪声主要影响低幅度维度，\n888\t    而correctness direction在high-variance维度上有强projection。 Direction cosine>0.987说明INT8和FP16下提取的correctness方向几乎相同。\n889\t    ECE差异稍大（0.8pp）因为calibration对probability scale更敏感，但仍在噪声范围内。 这排除了\"INT8 artifact\"的reviewer\n890\t    concern。\n891\t\n892\t    '\n893\t  tables:\n894\t  - name: 'Table S1: INT8 vs FP16 Comparison (Llama 4 Scout)'\n895\t    columns:\n896\t    - layer\n897\t    - int8_auroc\n898\t    - fp16_auroc\n899\t    - diff\n900\t    - direction_cosine\n901\t    rows:\n902\t    - - 8\n903\t      - 0.674\n904\t      - 0.678\n905\t      - -0.004\n906\t      - 0.991\n907\t    - - 16\n908\t      - 0.741\n909\t      - 0.745\n910\t      - -0.004\n911\t      - 0.989\n912\t    - - 24\n913\t      - 0.788\n914\t      - 0.791\n915\t      - -0.003\n916\t      - 0.992\n917\t    - - 32\n918\t      - 0.811\n919\t      - 0.814\n920\t      - -0.003\n921\t      - 0.99\n922\t    - - 40\n923\t      - 0.821\n924\t      - 0.827\n925\t      - -0.006\n926\t      - 0.987\n927\t  figures_description:\n928\t  - 'Fig S3: Bland-Altman plot — mean of INT8/FP16 AUROC (x) vs difference (y). All\n929\t    points within ±0.01 band. No systematic bias.'\n930\t  analysis: 'INT8量化不distort correctness signals。所有差异在bootstrap noise范围内。 Deep层差异略大（layer\n931\t    40: 0.6pp）符合预期——深层表征更complex，量化误差累积更多。 但0.6pp远小于实验效应（CaCLR +6pp），不影响任何结论。\n932\t\n933\t    '\n934\t- name: CKA Cross-Lingual Representation Similarity\n935\t  plan_id: plan_011\n936\t  description: 'CKA (linear kernel) between EN and each target language at every probed\n937\t    layer, correlated with transfer AUROC. Mechanistic explanation for Pareto frontier.\n938\t\n939\t    '\n940\t  expected_results:\n941\t    cka_transfer_pearson_r: 0.82\n942\t    cka_transfer_pearson_r_ci:\n943\t    - 0.76\n944\t    - 0.87\n945\t    cka_transfer_spearman_rho: 0.79\n946\t    cka_en_zh_by_depth_trend: monotonically decreasing from 0.92 (shallow) to 0.61\n947\t      (deep)\n948\t    cka_en_sw_by_depth_trend: monotonically decreasing from 0.84 (shallow) to 0.38\n949\t      (deep)\n950\t    cka_resource_tier_gradient:\n951\t      HIGH_mean_cka_at_optimal_depth: 0.78\n952\t      MID_mean_cka_at_optimal_depth: 0.71\n953\t      LOW_mean_cka_at_optimal_depth: 0.58\n954\t    geometric_misalignment_evidence: 'CKA drop from mid to deep layers exceeds what\n955\t      mean/covariance shift alone predicts. Subspace angle analysis shows correctness\n956\t      direction rotates 15-35° across languages at deep layers vs 5-12° at shallow\n957\t      layers.\n958\t\n959\t      '\n960\t    cka_explains_caclr_beta_limit: 'At layers where CKA < 0.55, β term provides diminishing\n961\t      returns because geometric misalignment (rotation) dominates distributional shift.\n962\t\n963\t      '\n964\t  result_rationale: 'CKA与transfer AUROC的高相关（r=0.82）提供了Pareto frontier的mechanistic\n965\t    explanation： cross-lingual表征相似度随depth monotonically下降，直接导致deep层transfer degradation。\n966\t    这不是trivial的\"深层更specific\"——CKA量化了具体的相似度数值并与transfer成功率 建立了定量关系。High-resource语言在所有depth保持更高CKA（因为pretraining\n967\t    data overlap）， 解释了resource tier gradient。 关键insight：deep层的CKA下降不仅是distributional\n968\t    shift（可被MMD修正）， 还包含geometric misalignment（correctness方向在语言间旋转15-35°）。 这解释了CaCLR\n969\t    β term在deep层效果减弱——MMD对齐分布但不学习旋转， 而linear projection学习旋转所以在deep层更稳定。 Subspace angle\n970\t    analysis区分了distributional vs geometric misalignment， 为Path A narrative提供了theoretical\n971\t    depth：CaCLR works at mid-depth因为 那里的misalignment主要是distributional的。\n972\t\n973\t    '\n974\t  tables:\n975\t  - name: 'Table 10: CKA by Depth and Resource Tier (Qwen3-235B)'\n976\t    columns:\n977\t    - depth_pct\n978\t    - HIGH_cka\n979\t    - MID_cka\n980\t    - LOW_cka\n981\t    - zs_auroc_median\n982\t    rows:\n983\t    - - 10\n984\t      - 0.93\n985\t      - 0.89\n986\t      - 0.84\n987\t      - 0.618\n988\t    - - 25\n989\t      - 0.9\n990\t      - 0.85\n991\t      - 0.78\n992\t      - 0.698\n993\t    - - 40\n994\t      - 0.86\n995\t      - 0.79\n996\t      - 0.69\n997\t      - 0.756\n998\t    - - 50\n999\t      - 0.82\n1000\t      - 0.74\n1001\t      - 0.62\n1002\t      - 0.771\n1003\t    - - 60\n1004\t      - 0.78\n1005\t      - 0.69\n1006\t      - 0.55\n1007\t      - 0.771\n1008\t    - - 70\n1009\t      - 0.73\n1010\t      - 0.63\n1011\t      - 0.47\n1012\t      - 0.741\n1013\t    - - 80\n1014\t      - 0.67\n1015\t      - 0.56\n1016\t      - 0.41\n1017\t      - 0.714\n1018\t    - - 90\n1019\t      - 0.61\n1020\t      - 0.49\n1021\t      - 0.35\n1022\t      - 0.688\n1023\t  figures_description:\n1024\t  - 'Fig 6a: Dual-axis — CKA (left y-axis, lines by tier) and ZS AUROC median (right\n1025\t    y-axis, dashed) vs normalized depth. CKA decrease tracks AUROC decrease after\n1026\t    elbow.'\n1027\t  - 'Fig 6b: Scatter — CKA vs ZS transfer AUROC, each point = language × layer. Strong\n1028\t    linear relationship (r=0.82). Color by resource tier.'\n1029\t  - 'Fig 6c: Subspace angle between EN and target correctness directions vs depth.\n1030\t    Angles increase with depth; LOW languages diverge faster.'\n1031\t  analysis: 'CKA analysis是论文的mechanistic backbone。它将observation（Pareto frontier） 与explanation（representation\n1032\t    geometry变化）和method（CaCLR的作用机制与局限） 连接起来。CKA<0.55作为CaCLR β有效性的threshold是一个actionable\n1033\t    finding—— 实践者可以用CKA预测CaCLR在哪些layer-language组合上有效。 Geometric vs distributional\n1034\t    misalignment的区分是theoretical contribution： 它解释了为什么distributional matching（MMD/CaCLR）在mid-depth有效但在deep层递减，\n1035\t    而geometric alignment（linear projection）在deep层更稳定。\n1036\t\n1037\t    '\n1038\t- name: Linear Projection Sensitivity Analysis\n1039\t  plan_id: plan_012\n1040\t  description: 'Linear projection pair count sweep (10, 20, 50, 100, 200). Both models\n1041\t    × 5 layers × 20 languages.\n1042\t\n1043\t    '\n1044\t  expected_results:\n1045\t    linear_proj_min_pairs_for_saturation: 35\n1046\t    saturation_criterion: 95% of 200-pair performance\n1047\t    pairs_sweep:\n1048\t      10:\n1049\t        median_auroc: 0.762\n1050\t        pct_of_200: 0.88\n1051\t      20:\n1052\t        median_auroc: 0.778\n1053\t        pct_of_200: 0.94\n1054\t      50:\n1055\t        median_auroc: 0.792\n1056\t        pct_of_200: 0.98\n1057\t      100:\n1058\t        median_auroc: 0.796\n1059\t        pct_of_200: 0.99\n1060\t      200:\n1061\t        median_auroc: 0.798\n1062\t        pct_of_200: 1.0\n1063\t    low_resource_saturation_later: true\n1064\t    low_resource_min_pairs: 48\n1065\t    high_resource_min_pairs: 22\n1066\t  result_rationale: 'Linear projection在~35 pairs时达到饱和（95% of 200-pair performance），\n1067\t    因为correctness方向是低维线性结构——学习一个旋转/缩放矩阵不需要很多样本。 10 pairs已经达到88%性能，说明即使极少数据也能捕获主要的geometric\n1068\t    transformation。 50 pairs后几乎无改善（98%→100%），符合线性映射的low sample complexity理论。 Low-resource语言需要slightly\n1069\t    more pairs（48 vs 22），因为表征空间中 correctness方向的SNR更低，需要更多样本来robustly估计映射。 整体saturation在20-50范围内，support\n1070\t    \"≤50 parallel pairs suffice\"的claim。 这建立了linear projection作为practical baseline的地位——\n1071\t    50 pairs在任何语言都容易获得（e.g., 翻译50个MCQA items）。\n1072\t\n1073\t    '\n1074\t  tables:\n1075\t  - name: 'Table 11: Linear Projection Data Efficiency (median across 20 langs × 2\n1076\t      models)'\n1077\t    columns:\n1078\t    - n_pairs\n1079\t    - median_auroc\n1080\t    - delta_vs_zs\n1081\t    - pct_of_200pair\n1082\t    - HIGH_auroc\n1083\t    - LOW_auroc\n1084\t    rows:\n1085\t    - - 10\n1086\t      - 0.762\n1087\t      - 0.027\n1088\t      - 88\n1089\t      - 0.781\n1090\t      - 0.638\n1091\t    - - 20\n1092\t      - 0.778\n1093\t      - 0.043\n1094\t      - 94\n1095\t      - 0.798\n1096\t      - 0.651\n1097\t    - - 50\n1098\t      - 0.792\n1099\t      - 0.057\n1100\t      - 98\n1101\t      - 0.814\n1102\t      - 0.664\n1103\t    - - 100\n1104\t      - 0.796\n1105\t      - 0.061\n1106\t      - 99\n1107\t      - 0.818\n1108\t      - 0.668\n1109\t    - - 200\n1110\t      - 0.798\n1111\t      - 0.063\n1112\t      - 100\n1113\t      - 0.821\n1114\t      - 0.671\n1115\t  figures_description:\n1116\t  - 'Fig S4: Learning curve — n_pairs (x, log) vs median AUROC (y). Rapid rise, plateau\n1117\t    at ~50. Separate lines for HIGH/MID/LOW tiers — all plateau but at different levels.'\n1118\t  analysis: 'Linear projection的data efficiency confirms它作为practical baseline的价值。 50\n1119\t    pairs的saturation point意味着任何有minimal translation capacity的语言 都可以使用这个方法。这也为CaCLR设定了benchmark：CaCLR需要beat\n1120\t    50-pair projection 才能justify its additional complexity（in best tier, CaCLR beats\n1121\t    by +1.4pp median）。\n1122\t\n1123\t    '\n1124\t- name: Probing Control Tasks (Hewitt & Liang 2019)\n1125\t  plan_id: plan_013\n1126\t  description: 'Random-label control probes at each layer. Selectivity = probe AUROC\n1127\t    - control AUROC. Validates genuine correctness signal.\n1128\t\n1129\t    '\n1130\t  expected_results:\n1131\t    control_task_auroc_range:\n1132\t    - 0.502\n1133\t    - 0.538\n1134\t    selectivity_median: 0.284\n1135\t    selectivity_min: 0.192\n1136\t    selectivity_max: 0.341\n1137\t    control_task_selectivity_min_across_langs: 0.192\n1138\t    selectivity_by_depth:\n1139\t      shallow: 0.218\n1140\t      mid: 0.294\n1141\t      deep: 0.312\n1142\t    selectivity_by_tier:\n1143\t      HIGH: 0.301\n1144\t      MID: 0.278\n1145\t      LOW: 0.234\n1146\t  result_rationale: 'Control probe AUROC在0.50-0.54范围（near chance），selectivity中位数0.284\n1147\t    远超15pp minimum threshold（min=19.2pp）。这confirm probe AUROC反映 genuine correctness\n1148\t    direction而非memorized artifacts或probe capacity。 Selectivity随depth增加（0.218→0.312），因为深层表征包含更丰富的correctness\n1149\t    信号而control仍在chance附近——深层probe的高AUROC不是因为probe容量过大。 Low-resource语言selectivity最低（0.234）但仍远超threshold，\n1150\t    说明即使低资源语言的correctness信号也是genuine的（不是noise fitting）。 这直接回应Hewitt & Liang probing\n1151\t    methodology critique—— 我们的probes确实在提取linguistic property而非exploiting high-dimensional\n1152\t    capacity。\n1153\t\n1154\t    '\n1155\t  tables:\n1156\t  - name: 'Table S2: Control Task Selectivity (Qwen3-235B, selected layers × languages)'\n1157\t    columns:\n1158\t    - layer\n1159\t    - en_selectivity\n1160\t    - zh_selectivity\n1161\t    - sw_selectivity\n1162\t    - control_auroc\n1163\t    rows:\n1164\t    - - 16\n1165\t      - 0.248\n1166\t      - 0.231\n1167\t      - 0.192\n1168\t      - 0.512\n1169\t    - - 32\n1170\t      - 0.281\n1171\t      - 0.268\n1172\t      - 0.218\n1173\t      - 0.519\n1174\t    - - 48\n1175\t      - 0.309\n1176\t      - 0.292\n1177\t      - 0.241\n1178\t      - 0.524\n1179\t    - - 56\n1180\t      - 0.318\n1181\t      - 0.301\n1182\t      - 0.248\n1183\t      - 0.521\n1184\t    - - 76\n1185\t      - 0.341\n1186\t      - 0.324\n1187\t      - 0.262\n1188\t      - 0.538\n1189\t  figures_description:\n1190\t  - 'Fig S5: Paired bar chart — probe AUROC (dark) vs control AUROC (light) at each\n1191\t    layer. Gap (selectivity) clearly visible and widening with depth. Horizontal line\n1192\t    at 15pp threshold.'\n1193\t  analysis: 'Control task validation是methodological necessity。Selectivity最小值19.2pp\n1194\t    大幅超过15pp阈值，即使在最challenging的条件（low-resource × shallow layer） 也确认probe是在提取genuine\n1195\t    signal。这让reviewer对所有downstream结果 （Pareto frontier, CaCLR, decomposition）更有信心。\n1196\t\n1197\t    '\n1198\t- name: Gemma 4 31B Dense — Camera-Ready Extension\n1199\t  plan_id: plan_008\n1200\t  description: 'Third architecture (dense, FP16), full Pareto frontier. Dense vs MoE\n1201\t    contrast for camera-ready.\n1202\t\n1203\t    '\n1204\t  expected_results:\n1205\t    en_best_auroc: 0.809\n1206\t    en_best_layer: 48\n1207\t    optimal_transfer_layer: 36\n1208\t    zs_transfer_auroc_median: 0.738\n1209\t    pareto_rho_median: -0.69\n1210\t    pareto_shape: smoother frontier than MoE models — no sharp elbow\n1211\t    dense_vs_moe_key_finding: 'Dense architecture shows shallower Pareto slope — transfer\n1212\t      degrades more gradually with depth compared to MoE models. Consistent with hypothesis\n1213\t      that expert routing accelerates language specialization.\n1214\t\n1215\t      '\n1216\t  result_rationale: 'Gemma 4 31B Dense作为dense对照提供了architectural contrast。 EN AUROC\n1217\t    0.809低于两个MoE模型（0.838, 0.821），反映31B dense参数<235B MoE active参数。 关键发现：dense架构的Pareto\n1218\t    frontier更平滑（rho=-0.69 vs MoE -0.73/-0.78）， 没有MoE的sharp elbow。这是因为MoE的expert routing在深层创造了discrete\n1219\t    language specialization（某些experts \"负责\"特定语言），而dense模型的specialization是gradual的。\n1220\t    这是architecture-dependent Pareto shape claim的strongest evidence。 Optimal transfer在75%深度（layer\n1221\t    36/48），比Qwen3浅（60%）但比Scout深（50%）， 提供了第三个data point来characterize architecture-depth\n1222\t    relationship。\n1223\t\n1224\t    '\n1225\t  tables:\n1226\t  - name: 'Table S3: Three-Architecture Comparison Summary'\n1227\t    columns:\n1228\t    - model\n1229\t    - type\n1230\t    - params\n1231\t    - layers\n1232\t    - en_best_auroc\n1233\t    - zs_median\n1234\t    - optimal_transfer_pct\n1235\t    - pareto_rho\n1236\t    rows:\n1237\t    - - Qwen3-235B-A22B\n1238\t      - MoE\n1239\t      - 235B\n1240\t      - 94\n1241\t      - 0.838\n1242\t      - 0.758\n1243\t      - 60\n1244\t      - -0.78\n1245\t    - - Llama 4 Scout\n1246\t      - MoE\n1247\t      - 109B (17B active)\n1248\t      - 48\n1249\t      - 0.821\n1250\t      - 0.742\n1251\t      - 50\n1252\t      - -0.73\n1253\t    - - Gemma 4 31B Dense\n1254\t      - Dense\n1255\t      - 31B\n1256\t      - 60\n1257\t      - 0.809\n1258\t      - 0.738\n1259\t      - 75\n1260\t      - -0.69\n1261\t  figures_description:\n1262\t  - 'Fig S6: Three Pareto frontiers overlaid on normalized depth axis. MoE models\n1263\t    show sharper elbows; Dense model is smoother. Annotated with optimal transfer\n1264\t    depth for each.'\n1265\t  analysis: 'Three-architecture comparison is the crown jewel of Claim 1。 Dense vs\n1266\t    MoE对比provides causal insight into WHY frontiers differ—— expert routing is the\n1267\t    mechanism driving sharp language specialization at depth.\n1268\t\n1269\t    '\n1270\t- name: Extended Language Coverage — Camera-Ready\n1271\t  plan_id: plan_009\n1272\t  description: 'Expand from 20 to 50+ languages. Camera-ready extension using GlobalMMLU/Belebele\n1273\t    full sets.\n1274\t\n1275\t    '\n1276\t  expected_results:\n1277\t    total_languages: 52\n1278\t    zs_langs_above_0p65: 38\n1279\t    zs_auroc_median_52lang: 0.721\n1280\t    new_low_resource_findings: 'Several additional low-resource languages (e.g., Yoruba,\n1281\t      Hausa, Malagasy) show ZS AUROC 0.58-0.64, confirming resource-tier gradient\n1282\t      extends to tail.\n1283\t\n1284\t      '\n1285\t    pareto_frontier_robust: true\n1286\t    caclr_generalizes: true\n1287\t    caclr_delta_over_zs_52lang_median: 0.058\n1288\t  result_rationale: '52语言验证confirms所有findings at broader scale。ZS median从20 langs的0.758\n1289\t    降到52 langs的0.721，因为新增语言主要是低资源的——这是expected的composition effect。 38/52 > 0.65（73%）vs\n1290\t    17/20（85%），比例下降也反映低资源语言的加入。 Pareto frontier和CaCLR在所有语言上consistent，说明findings是language-general的。\n1291\t    Key new finding：Yoruba/Hausa等sub-Saharan African语言的ZS AUROC（0.58-0.62） 与sw/bn相当，但CaCLR对这些语言的improvement更大（+7-9pp），\n1292\t    可能因为GlobalMMLU translations provide parallel data that partially bridges the representation\n1293\t    gap for these extremely low-resource languages.\n1294\t\n1295\t    '\n1296\t  tables:\n1297\t  - name: 'Table S4: Extended Language Coverage Summary'\n1298\t    columns:\n1299\t    - resource_tier\n1300\t    - n_langs\n1301\t    - zs_auroc_median\n1302\t    - caclr_median\n1303\t    - delta\n1304\t    rows:\n1305\t    - - HIGH\n1306\t      - 12\n1307\t      - 0.786\n1308\t      - 0.828\n1309\t      - 0.042\n1310\t    - - MID\n1311\t      - 18\n1312\t      - 0.741\n1313\t      - 0.798\n1314\t      - 0.057\n1315\t    - - LOW\n1316\t      - 22\n1317\t      - 0.648\n1318\t      - 0.721\n1319\t      - 0.073\n1320\t  figures_description:\n1321\t  - 'Fig S7: World map — ZS AUROC by country/language, color gradient from red (low)\n1322\t    to green (high). Clear geographic pattern tracking resource availability.'\n1323\t  analysis: Extended coverage是camera-ready的scale argument。核心findings在52语言上robust。\n1324\t    Low-resource语言从CaCLR获益最多（+7.3pp vs HIGH +4.2pp）， because these languages have\n1325\t    the most room for improvement and CaCLR's distributional alignment compensates\n1326\t    for sparse pretraining representation.\n1327\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"d1221443-c15e-4888-b9c9-64cd2c74844d","uuid":"658c2477-2fce-4b99-aaef-3291062fa6c1","timestamp":"2026-05-20T20:58:43.587Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0519_2/projects/xling_calib_direction/artifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260520T201854/best/review_context.yaml","content":"narrative_guidance: 'Full method contribution paper (Path A). CaCLR consistency loss\n  provides meaningful gain, confirming distributional matching via MMD helps align\n  capability-specific signals at mid-depth layers. Causal chain complete: Pareto frontier\n  discovered on both architectures with architecture-dependent shape → decomposition\n  explains frontier via difficulty/capability separation → CaCLR shifts frontier by\n  aligning capability-specific components → orthogonality bounds output-based approaches\n  across all languages. CKA provides mechanistic glue linking representation geometry\n  to transfer success. Headline: \"CaCLR-trained correctness probes reduce non-English\n  ECE by 3.5% over temperature scaling with zero target-language labels across 20\n  languages on Qwen3-235B and Llama 4 Scout.\"\n\n  '\nimagined_experiments:\n- name: Full Pareto Frontier — Qwen3-235B-A22B\n  plan_id: plan_001\n  description: '94-layer MoE model, INT8, 24 probed layers (every 4th), 20 languages,\n    5 transfer conditions (zero-shot, mean-shift, linear projection, few-shot 25/100,\n    CaCLR).\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    en_best_auroc: 0.838\n    en_best_layer: 76\n    en_best_ece_raw: 0.162\n    en_best_ece_tempcal: 0.048\n    temp_scaling_T: 4.83\n    en_auroc_range:\n    - 0.592\n    - 0.838\n    optimal_transfer_layer_median: 56\n    zs_transfer_auroc_median_20lang: 0.758\n    zs_transfer_auroc_at_en_optimal_layer76: 0.714\n    zs_transfer_auroc_at_transfer_optimal_layer56: 0.771\n    pareto_rho_global: -0.81\n    pareto_rho_per_lang_median: -0.78\n    pareto_rho_per_lang_iqr:\n    - -0.84\n    - -0.71\n    zs_langs_above_0p65_out_of_20: 17\n    best_zs_auroc_by_tier:\n      HIGH_zh: 0.793\n      HIGH_es: 0.801\n      HIGH_fr: 0.798\n      HIGH_de: 0.784\n      MID_hi: 0.742\n      MID_ru: 0.769\n      MID_ko: 0.751\n      MID_tr: 0.738\n      LOW_sw: 0.641\n      LOW_bn: 0.633\n    mean_shift_delta_auroc_median: 0.0\n    linear_proj_delta_auroc_over_zs_median: 0.048\n    fewshot_25_delta_auroc_over_zs_median: 0.032\n    fewshot_100_delta_auroc_over_zs_median: 0.055\n  result_rationale: 'Qwen3-235B-A22B的94层深度和MoE架构产生了强correctness信号。235B参数量使EN AUROC达到0.838，\n    远超7B MVP的0.754——更大模型的内部表征更丰富、correctness方向更可分离。 Pareto frontier清晰存在：layer 76（81%深度）是EN最优但跨语言transfer在此处下降约5.7pp\n    （从layer 56的0.771降至0.714），因为深层表征越来越language-specific。 MoE架构中expert routing在深层更加language-dependent，强化了这一效应。\n    Spearman rho中位数-0.78反映depth-transfer反相关在绝大多数语言中一致。 17/20语言ZS AUROC>0.65体现了235B模型强大的multilingual\n    representation—— 仅sw/bn/my三个极低资源语言未达标，符合Ben-David H-divergence理论预测。 Mean-shift\n    ΔAUROC=0.000由rank-invariance定理保证（StandardScaler + logistic regression下 mean-shift仅添加常数偏移，不改变rank\n    order）。 Linear projection作为强baseline（+4.8pp）反映correctness方向在语言间存在可学习的线性映射关系。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 1: Qwen3-235B Pareto Frontier — EN AUROC vs ZS Transfer AUROC by\n      Layer'\n    columns:\n    - layer\n    - depth_pct\n    - en_auroc\n    - zs_median_auroc\n    - zs_min_auroc\n    - zs_max_auroc\n    - rho_median\n    rows:\n    - - 0\n      - 0\n      - 0.592\n      - 0.583\n      - 0.521\n      - 0.601\n      - null\n    - - 8\n      - 9\n      - 0.631\n      - 0.618\n      - 0.554\n      - 0.639\n      - null\n    - - 16\n      - 17\n      - 0.672\n      - 0.659\n      - 0.589\n      - 0.678\n      - null\n    - - 24\n      - 26\n      - 0.711\n      - 0.698\n      - 0.621\n      - 0.719\n      - null\n    - - 32\n      - 34\n      - 0.738\n      - 0.729\n      - 0.648\n      - 0.751\n      - null\n    - - 40\n      - 43\n      - 0.762\n      - 0.756\n      - 0.662\n      - 0.778\n      - null\n    - - 48\n      - 51\n      - 0.781\n      - 0.771\n      - 0.658\n      - 0.793\n      - null\n    - - 56\n      - 60\n      - 0.798\n      - 0.771\n      - 0.641\n      - 0.801\n      - null\n    - - 60\n      - 64\n      - 0.808\n      - 0.762\n      - 0.632\n      - 0.796\n      - null\n    - - 64\n      - 68\n      - 0.816\n      - 0.751\n      - 0.618\n      - 0.788\n      - null\n    - - 68\n      - 72\n      - 0.824\n      - 0.741\n      - 0.607\n      - 0.779\n      - null\n    - - 72\n      - 77\n      - 0.831\n      - 0.728\n      - 0.598\n      - 0.768\n      - null\n    - - 76\n      - 81\n      - 0.838\n      - 0.714\n      - 0.584\n      - 0.756\n      - null\n    - - 80\n      - 85\n      - 0.835\n      - 0.702\n      - 0.571\n      - 0.742\n      - null\n    - - 84\n      - 89\n      - 0.829\n      - 0.688\n      - 0.558\n      - 0.729\n      - null\n    - - 88\n      - 94\n      - 0.818\n      - 0.671\n      - 0.542\n      - 0.712\n      - null\n    - - 92\n      - 98\n      - 0.801\n      - 0.649\n      - 0.523\n      - 0.694\n      - null\n  - name: 'Table 2: Qwen3-235B Transfer Conditions at Fixed Layers (layer 56 + layer\n      76)'\n    columns:\n    - condition\n    - layer56_median_auroc\n    - layer76_median_auroc\n    - delta_vs_zs_l56\n    - delta_vs_zs_l76\n    rows:\n    - - zero-shot\n      - 0.771\n      - 0.714\n      - 0.0\n      - 0.0\n    - - mean-shift\n      - 0.771\n      - 0.714\n      - 0.0\n      - 0.0\n    - - linear_proj_50pairs\n      - 0.812\n      - 0.779\n      - 0.041\n      - 0.065\n    - - fewshot_25\n      - 0.798\n      - 0.761\n      - 0.027\n      - 0.047\n    - - fewshot_100\n      - 0.821\n      - 0.792\n      - 0.05\n      - 0.078\n    - - CaCLR_full\n      - 0.828\n      - 0.788\n      - 0.057\n      - 0.074\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig 1a: Pareto frontier scatter — x-axis EN AUROC, y-axis ZS transfer AUROC median.\n    Each point is a layer. Clear concave frontier with elbow at ~60% depth. Color\n    by resource tier shows HIGH langs cluster top-right, LOW langs bottom-left.'\n  - 'Fig 1b: Heatmap 24 layers × 20 languages, cell color = ZS AUROC. Visible gradient:\n    warm (high AUROC) at mid-depth for high-resource, shifting to shallower optimum\n    for low-resource.'\n  - 'Fig 1c: Per-language Spearman rho distribution (violin plot). Median -0.78, tight\n    IQR, all languages negative. Annotate sw/bn as outliers with weaker rho.'\n  analysis: 'Pareto frontier 在 Qwen3-235B 上形态清晰。拐点在 layer 56（60% depth）—— 此后EN AUROC继续上升但ZS\n    transfer开始下降。MoE架构的expert routing在深层 更加language-specific是造成Pareto tradeoff的主要机制。High-resource语言\n    （zh/es/fr/de）的frontier更靠右上方，因为这些语言在pretraining中获得更多 token coverage，deep-layer\n    representation与EN的对齐更好。Low-resource（sw/bn） 即使在最优transfer层也仅达到0.64左右，符合H-divergence理论预测。\n\n    '\n- name: Full Pareto Frontier — Llama 4 Scout\n  plan_id: plan_002\n  description: '48-layer MoE model, INT8, 12 probed layers (every 4th), 20 languages,\n    5 transfer conditions.\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    en_best_auroc: 0.821\n    en_best_layer: 40\n    en_best_ece_raw: 0.171\n    en_best_ece_tempcal: 0.053\n    temp_scaling_T: 5.12\n    en_auroc_range:\n    - 0.604\n    - 0.821\n    optimal_transfer_layer_median: 24\n    zs_transfer_auroc_median_20lang: 0.742\n    zs_transfer_auroc_at_en_optimal_layer40: 0.698\n    zs_transfer_auroc_at_transfer_optimal_layer24: 0.756\n    pareto_rho_global: -0.76\n    pareto_rho_per_lang_median: -0.73\n    pareto_rho_per_lang_iqr:\n    - -0.81\n    - -0.66\n    zs_langs_above_0p65_out_of_20: 16\n    best_zs_auroc_by_tier:\n      HIGH_zh: 0.778\n      HIGH_es: 0.789\n      HIGH_fr: 0.781\n      HIGH_de: 0.772\n      MID_hi: 0.728\n      MID_ru: 0.756\n      MID_ko: 0.739\n      MID_tr: 0.721\n      LOW_sw: 0.628\n      LOW_bn: 0.618\n    mean_shift_delta_auroc_median: 0.0\n    linear_proj_delta_auroc_over_zs_median: 0.044\n  result_rationale: 'Llama 4 Scout的48层架构使optimal transfer层在50%深度（layer 24）， 而Qwen3-235B在60%深度（layer\n    56）——这就是architecture-dependent shape的关键证据。 Scout的层数不到Qwen的一半，deep层的language specialization发生得更快（按比例）。\n    EN best AUROC=0.821略低于Qwen的0.838，反映Scout虽然是MoE但active参数更少。 ZS median 0.742 vs\n    Qwen的0.758，差距16pp体现了Llama系列multilingual pretraining 数据在低资源语言上的相对弱势。Pareto rho中位数-0.73略弱于Qwen的-0.78，\n    因为Scout只有12个probed层，frontier采样更粗糙。16/20语言>0.65（vs Qwen 17/20）， sw/bn/my/jv四个低资源语言未达标。Architecture-dependent差异是本文Claim\n    1的核心发现。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 3: Llama 4 Scout Pareto Frontier'\n    columns:\n    - layer\n    - depth_pct\n    - en_auroc\n    - zs_median_auroc\n    rows:\n    - - 0\n      - 0\n      - 0.604\n      - 0.592\n    - - 4\n      - 8\n      - 0.638\n      - 0.624\n    - - 8\n      - 17\n      - 0.674\n      - 0.661\n    - - 12\n      - 25\n      - 0.712\n      - 0.701\n    - - 16\n      - 33\n      - 0.741\n      - 0.738\n    - - 20\n      - 42\n      - 0.768\n      - 0.756\n    - - 24\n      - 50\n      - 0.788\n      - 0.756\n    - - 28\n      - 58\n      - 0.801\n      - 0.742\n    - - 32\n      - 67\n      - 0.811\n      - 0.726\n    - - 36\n      - 75\n      - 0.818\n      - 0.711\n    - - 40\n      - 83\n      - 0.821\n      - 0.698\n    - - 44\n      - 92\n      - 0.814\n      - 0.679\n    - - 48\n      - 100\n      - 0.798\n      - 0.654\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig 2a: Pareto frontiers overlaid — Qwen3-235B (blue) vs Llama 4 Scout (orange).\n    Both concave but elbow position differs: Qwen at 60% depth, Scout at 50%. Demonstrates\n    architecture-dependent shape.'\n  - 'Fig 2b: Architecture comparison heatmap — difference in ZS AUROC (Qwen minus\n    Scout) by language × normalized depth. Positive (Qwen better) at deep layers for\n    high-resource; near zero at shallow layers.'\n  analysis: '两个架构的Pareto frontier在归一化深度上呈现不同形状：Qwen3-235B的拐点在60%深度， Scout在50%深度。这一差异不能由模型大小alone解释（两者都是MoE），\n    而是反映了训练数据分布、expert routing策略和层归一化实现的差异。 Scout在每层的language specialization更剧烈，导致frontier更陡峭、拐点更早。\n    这是论文最核心的发现之一：optimal transfer depth不是universal的，必须per-architecture确定。\n\n    '\n- name: CaCLR Implementation and Comparative Evaluation\n  plan_id: plan_003\n  description: 'CaCLR (L_BCE + α·L_SB-ECE + β·L_MMD) 训练、超参数sweep、与所有baseline的全面比较。\n    Path A: β term provides meaningful gain.\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    caclr_optimal_alpha: 1.0\n    caclr_optimal_beta: 0.1\n    caclr_beta_delta_auroc_over_alpha_only_median: 0.032\n    caclr_beta_delta_auroc_over_alpha_only_range:\n    - 0.018\n    - 0.051\n    caclr_full_delta_auroc_over_zeroshot_median: 0.062\n    caclr_full_delta_auroc_over_zeroshot_range:\n    - 0.031\n    - 0.098\n    caclr_vs_linear_proj_delta_median: 0.014\n    caclr_vs_fewshot100_delta_median: -0.008\n    ece_reduction_vs_temp_scaling_median: 0.035\n    ece_reduction_vs_temp_scaling_range:\n    - 0.012\n    - 0.061\n    beta_sweep_results:\n      beta_0.001:\n        delta_auroc_over_alpha_only: 0.008\n        note: too weak\n      beta_0.01:\n        delta_auroc_over_alpha_only: 0.019\n        note: marginal\n      beta_0.1:\n        delta_auroc_over_alpha_only: 0.032\n        note: optimal\n      beta_1.0:\n        delta_auroc_over_alpha_only: 0.021\n        note: overfitting to distributional match\n    alpha_sweep_results:\n      alpha_0.01:\n        en_ece: 0.068\n        transfer_auroc_median: 0.779\n      alpha_0.1:\n        en_ece: 0.055\n        transfer_auroc_median: 0.793\n      alpha_1.0:\n        en_ece: 0.041\n        transfer_auroc_median: 0.808\n      alpha_10.0:\n        en_ece: 0.038\n        transfer_auroc_median: 0.791\n    layer_interaction:\n      mid_depth_beta_gain: 0.041\n      deep_layer_beta_gain: 0.024\n      shallow_layer_beta_gain: 0.018\n    qwen_results:\n      layer56_caclr_full_median: 0.828\n      layer76_caclr_full_median: 0.788\n    scout_results:\n      layer24_caclr_full_median: 0.812\n      layer40_caclr_full_median: 0.771\n    bootstrap_ci_beta_effect:\n    - 0.019\n    - 0.045\n    paired_permutation_p_beta: 0.003\n    cohens_d_beta: 0.48\n  result_rationale: 'CaCLR consistency loss (β term) 提供了有意义的增益（中位数+3.2pp over α-only），\n    支持Path A叙事。β=0.1是最优点——更低（0.001-0.01）则MMD约束太弱无法对齐分布， 更高（1.0）则过度约束导致correctness\n    prediction损失。 β增益在mid-depth层（40-60%）最大（+4.1pp），因为这些层的cross-lingual表征 仍有足够的共享结构让MMD可以有效对齐，但已经开始出现分化需要对齐。\n    在deep层β增益下降到+2.4pp，因为表征的geometric misalignment（非仅distributional shift） 限制了MMD的有效性——但CaCLR仍然比zero-shot好得多。\n    CaCLR vs linear projection：CaCLR赢1.4pp中位数，因为它同时优化calibration（α项） 和alignment（β项），而linear\n    projection仅做alignment。但CaCLR略输于few-shot 100 （-0.8pp），因为100个标注样本提供了直接的target-language\n    correctness信号。 关键：CaCLR不需要target-language labels，这是实际场景中的核心优势。 ECE reduction vs\n    temp scaling中位数3.5pp，因为CaCLR在训练时直接优化SB-ECE， 而temp scaling仅做post-hoc rescaling无法修复表征层面的miscalibration。\n    Bootstrap CI [0.019, 0.045]和p=0.003确认β效应统计显著；Cohen''s d=0.48为中等效应量。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 4: Transfer Method Comparison (Median AUROC across 20 languages,\n      both models)'\n    columns:\n    - method\n    - labels_needed\n    - qwen_layer56\n    - qwen_layer76\n    - scout_layer24\n    - scout_layer40\n    - median_all\n    rows:\n    - - zero-shot\n      - 0\n      - 0.771\n      - 0.714\n      - 0.756\n      - 0.698\n      - 0.735\n    - - mean-shift\n      - 0\n      - 0.771\n      - 0.714\n      - 0.756\n      - 0.698\n      - 0.735\n    - - CaCLR_alpha_only\n      - 0 (parallel inputs)\n      - 0.798\n      - 0.762\n      - 0.784\n      - 0.745\n      - 0.772\n    - - CaCLR_full\n      - 0 (parallel inputs)\n      - 0.828\n      - 0.788\n      - 0.812\n      - 0.771\n      - 0.8\n    - - linear_proj_50\n      - 50 parallel pairs\n      - 0.812\n      - 0.779\n      - 0.798\n      - 0.758\n      - 0.787\n    - - fewshot_25\n      - 25\n      - 0.798\n      - 0.761\n      - 0.781\n      - 0.741\n      - 0.77\n    - - fewshot_100\n      - 100\n      - 0.821\n      - 0.792\n      - 0.808\n      - 0.778\n      - 0.8\n  - name: 'Table 5: β Sensitivity Sweep (Qwen3-235B, layer 56, median across 20 langs)'\n    columns:\n    - beta\n    - delta_auroc_over_alpha_only\n    - delta_ece_over_alpha_only\n    - note\n    rows:\n    - - 0.001\n      - 0.008\n      - -0.003\n      - negligible distributional constraint\n    - - 0.01\n      - 0.019\n      - -0.008\n      - marginal improvement\n    - - 0.1\n      - 0.032\n      - -0.014\n      - optimal — balances alignment and prediction\n    - - 1.0\n      - 0.021\n      - -0.011\n      - over-regularized — MMD dominates loss\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig 3a: Bar chart — 5 transfer methods × 2 models at optimal transfer layer.\n    CaCLR_full highest, followed by fewshot_100, linear_proj, CaCLR_alpha_only, zero-shot.\n    Error bars = bootstrap 95% CI.'\n  - 'Fig 3b: β sweep curve — x-axis β (log scale), y-axis ΔAUROC over α-only. Inverted-U\n    shape peaking at β=0.1. Three lines for shallow/mid/deep layers showing mid-depth\n    benefits most.'\n  - 'Fig 3c: Pareto frontier shift — original ZS frontier (dashed) vs CaCLR frontier\n    (solid) for both architectures. CaCLR pushes frontier up and right, especially\n    at mid-depth.'\n  analysis: 'CaCLR的consistency loss在mid-depth层效果最好，这与CKA分析（plan_011）一致： mid-depth层的cross-lingual表征相似度足够高让MMD有效对齐，但已经有enough\n    language-specific分化使得对齐产生实际收益。β=0.1的inverted-U曲线说明 distributional matching存在sweet\n    spot——太弱无效，太强则牺牲correctness prediction。 CaCLR vs fewshot_100的near-parity（-0.8pp）是重要结果：CaCLR达到了接近\n    100-label supervised的性能，但不需要任何target-language correctness labels。 统计显著性（p=0.003,\n    d=0.48）确保β效应不是噪声。\n\n    '\n- name: Difficulty-Controlled Decomposition Ablation\n  plan_id: plan_004\n  description: 'IRT difficulty probes → project out difficulty → retrain correctness\n    probes → evaluate transfer. 10 languages × 8 layers × 2 models.\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    decomposition_transfer_delta_after_difficulty_removal_median: 0.031\n    decomposition_transfer_delta_range:\n    - 0.011\n    - 0.052\n    difficulty_probe_r2_median: 0.68\n    difficulty_direction_cosine_with_correctness: 0.34\n    capability_specific_transfer_degradation_per_depth:\n      shallow_20pct: 0.008\n      mid_50pct: 0.024\n      deep_80pct: 0.048\n    random_direction_control_delta: 0.002\n    resource_tier_pattern:\n      HIGH_delta: 0.022\n      MID_delta: 0.033\n      LOW_delta: 0.041\n    bootstrap_ci_decomposition_delta:\n    - 0.018\n    - 0.044\n    paired_permutation_p: 0.006\n    cohens_d: 0.41\n  result_rationale: 'Difficulty direction与correctness direction有中等cosine（0.34），说明两者共享\n    部分信号但不完全重叠。Project out difficulty后，残差中的correctness信号更 \"capability-pure\"——这个信号在高资源语言间更容易transfer（+2.2pp），\n    因为capability-specific failures在这些语言间更一致。低资源语言获益最大（+4.1pp）， 因为原始correctness方向中difficulty成分占比更高（低资源语言的difficulty分布\n    与EN差异更大），去除difficulty后暴露出更可transfer的capability信号。 深层退化更明显（4.8pp）因为深层同时编码了更多language-specific的difficulty信息。\n    Random-direction control仅+0.2pp，排除了dimensionality reduction artifact—— 是difficulty方向的specific\n    removal而非arbitrary降维带来的改善。 这个分解是prescriptive的：它告诉我们哪些language-layer组合需要capability\n    alignment （高delta = 高difficulty entanglement = 需要CaCLR/projection）。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 6: Decomposition Effect by Resource Tier and Depth (ΔAUROC after\n      difficulty removal)'\n    columns:\n    - depth_pct\n    - HIGH_avg\n    - MID_avg\n    - LOW_avg\n    - random_control\n    rows:\n    - - 20\n      - 0.012\n      - 0.014\n      - 0.019\n      - 0.001\n    - - 35\n      - 0.016\n      - 0.022\n      - 0.028\n      - 0.002\n    - - 50\n      - 0.021\n      - 0.031\n      - 0.038\n      - 0.002\n    - - 60\n      - 0.024\n      - 0.036\n      - 0.043\n      - 0.003\n    - - 70\n      - 0.026\n      - 0.039\n      - 0.046\n      - 0.002\n    - - 80\n      - 0.028\n      - 0.041\n      - 0.048\n      - 0.003\n    - - 85\n      - 0.025\n      - 0.038\n      - 0.044\n      - 0.002\n    - - 90\n      - 0.022\n      - 0.034\n      - 0.041\n      - 0.002\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig 4a: Three-panel heatmap (HIGH/MID/LOW) — 8 layers × decomposition delta.\n    Gradient intensifies with depth and decreases with resource level.'\n  - 'Fig 4b: Scatter plot — difficulty-correctness cosine similarity vs decomposition\n    delta. Each point = language × layer. Clear positive correlation (r=0.71).'\n  - 'Fig 4c: Bar chart — decomposition delta vs random-direction control delta at\n    each depth. Orders of magnitude difference confirms specificity.'\n  analysis: 'Decomposition结果支持Claim 2：difficulty和capability在correctness方向中可分离， 且分离后capability-specific信号的cross-lingual\n    transfer一致改善。 关键insight是resource tier gradient——低资源语言的difficulty entanglement最严重，\n    也从decomposition中获益最多。这为CaCLR提供了theoretical motivation： CaCLR的consistency loss本质上在做distributional\n    alignment of capability-specific signals。 Random-direction control（~0pp）是关键的methodological\n    guard rail。\n\n    '\n- name: Cross-Lingual Orthogonality Analysis\n  plan_id: plan_005\n  description: 'Correctness-confidence cosine similarity across 20 languages × 2 architectures,\n    analyzed by resource tier and language family.\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    orthogonality_cosine_mean_across_langs: 0.042\n    orthogonality_cosine_max_across_langs: 0.062\n    orthogonality_cosine_min_across_langs: 0.018\n    orthogonality_cosine_std: 0.013\n    cosine_by_tier:\n      HIGH_mean: 0.038\n      MID_mean: 0.043\n      LOW_mean: 0.051\n    cosine_by_architecture:\n      qwen_mean: 0.039\n      scout_mean: 0.046\n    cosine_range_qwen_20lang:\n    - 0.018\n    - 0.058\n    cosine_range_scout_20lang:\n    - 0.022\n    - 0.062\n    all_20_langs_below_0p08: true\n    bootstrap_ci_mean_cosine:\n    - 0.035\n    - 0.049\n  result_rationale: 'Orthogonality在所有20语言 × 2架构上持续存在（max cosine 0.062 < 0.08阈值）， 确认Miao\n    & Ungar (2026)的English-only发现是universal structural property。 Low-resource语言cosine略高（0.051\n    vs HIGH 0.038），因为这些语言的confidence probe quality更低（更少训练数据→confidence方向估计噪声更大→与correctness的\n    apparent cosine被噪声inflate）。但即使是最高的0.062也远低于non-orthogonal阈值， 说明output-based calibration在结构上受限不依赖于语言。\n    Qwen略比Scout更orthogonal（0.039 vs 0.046），可能反映Qwen更大的模型容量 使correctness和confidence能被编码在更分离的子空间中。\n    这个发现bounds entire output-based calibration approach：无论语言或架构， verbalized confidence不包含correctness信息，motivating\n    probe-based方法。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 7: Correctness-Confidence Cosine Similarity by Language'\n    columns:\n    - language\n    - tier\n    - qwen_cosine\n    - scout_cosine\n    - mean\n    rows:\n    - - en\n      - HIGH\n      - 0.031\n      - 0.037\n      - 0.034\n    - - zh\n      - HIGH\n      - 0.035\n      - 0.041\n      - 0.038\n    - - es\n      - HIGH\n      - 0.033\n      - 0.039\n      - 0.036\n    - - fr\n      - HIGH\n      - 0.034\n      - 0.04\n      - 0.037\n    - - de\n      - HIGH\n      - 0.036\n      - 0.042\n      - 0.039\n    - - hi\n      - MID\n      - 0.039\n      - 0.045\n      - 0.042\n    - - ru\n      - MID\n      - 0.037\n      - 0.043\n      - 0.04\n    - - ko\n      - MID\n      - 0.041\n      - 0.047\n      - 0.044\n    - - tr\n      - MID\n      - 0.043\n      - 0.049\n      - 0.046\n    - - sw\n      - LOW\n      - 0.048\n      - 0.056\n      - 0.052\n    - - bn\n      - LOW\n      - 0.052\n      - 0.058\n      - 0.055\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig 5: Dot plot — cosine similarity per language, sorted by resource tier. Horizontal\n    line at 0.08 threshold. All points below. Color by architecture (Qwen blue, Scout\n    orange). Visible tier gradient.'\n  analysis: 'Cross-lingual orthogonality的universal persistence是论文的bounding contribution。\n    它回答了\"为什么需要probe-based calibration\"：因为output-based方法在结构上 无法获取correctness信息（cosine<0.08），无论语言。Resource\n    tier gradient 是nuanced finding但不影响main conclusion。\n\n    '\n- name: Probe Complexity Comparison\n  plan_id: plan_006\n  description: 'Logistic regression vs 2-layer MLP across all probed layers, both\n    models. EN accuracy, cross-lingual transfer degradation, calibration comparison.\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    lr_en_best_auroc_qwen: 0.838\n    mlp_en_best_auroc_qwen: 0.852\n    lr_en_best_auroc_scout: 0.821\n    mlp_en_best_auroc_scout: 0.834\n    lr_zs_transfer_degradation_median: 0.068\n    mlp_zs_transfer_degradation_median: 0.104\n    lr_transfer_advantage_over_mlp_median: 0.022\n    lr_ece_vs_mlp_ece:\n    - -0.008\n    - 0.003\n    mlp_overfit_indicator_deep_layers: true\n  result_rationale: 'Linear probes在EN AUROC上略输MLP（~1.4pp），但在cross-lingual transfer上\n    显著更好（+2.2pp median）。MLP的额外容量捕获了EN-specific patterns导致更多 overfitting to source\n    language——这些patterns在target语言中不泛化。 这与probe complexity literature一致（Hewitt & Liang\n    2019）：更强的probe 在source domain表现更好但generalization更差。Linear probe的inductive bias\n    （只能学习线性可分方向）恰好与correctness direction的线性结构匹配， 同时限制了对language-specific artifacts的拟合。\n    在deep层这个差异更大（MLP overfitting更严重），因为deep层表征更language-specific。 这个结果support使用logistic\n    regression作为primary probe的选择。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 8: Probe Complexity — EN AUROC vs ZS Transfer (Qwen3-235B, selected\n      layers)'\n    columns:\n    - layer\n    - lr_en\n    - mlp_en\n    - lr_zs_median\n    - mlp_zs_median\n    - lr_transfer_advantage\n    rows:\n    - - 24\n      - 0.711\n      - 0.722\n      - 0.698\n      - 0.691\n      - 0.007\n    - - 40\n      - 0.762\n      - 0.778\n      - 0.756\n      - 0.741\n      - 0.015\n    - - 56\n      - 0.798\n      - 0.814\n      - 0.771\n      - 0.752\n      - 0.019\n    - - 76\n      - 0.838\n      - 0.852\n      - 0.714\n      - 0.686\n      - 0.028\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig S1: Dual-axis plot — EN AUROC (solid) and ZS transfer AUROC (dashed) vs layer\n    depth, separate lines for LR and MLP. MLP''s solid line higher but dashed line\n    lower, scissors gap widens at deep layers.'\n  analysis: 'Linear probe是正确的default choice。MLP的EN优势被transfer劣势完全抵消。 这个结果also间接支持correctness\n    direction是线性的——linear probe已经捕获了 大部分信号，MLP额外捕获的主要是noise/language-specific artifact。\n\n    '\n- name: Additional Benchmark Evaluation (Belebele + MMLU-ProX)\n  plan_id: plan_007\n  description: 'Best probes + CaCLR在Belebele和MMLU-ProX上的评估，验证beyond-GlobalMMLU泛化。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    belebele_zs_auroc_median: 0.731\n    belebele_caclr_auroc_median: 0.789\n    mmlu_prox_zs_auroc_median: 0.748\n    mmlu_prox_caclr_auroc_median: 0.801\n    cross_benchmark_correlation: 0.92\n    belebele_pareto_rho_median: -0.71\n    mmlu_prox_pareto_rho_median: -0.75\n  result_rationale: 'Belebele（reading comprehension）的ZS AUROC略低于GlobalMMLU（0.731 vs\n    0.758）， 因为不同任务的correctness信号分布不完全一致——但Pareto frontier仍然存在 （rho=-0.71），说明depth-transfer\n    tradeoff是task-general的。 MMLU-ProX与GlobalMMLU最相似（同为knowledge QA），所以结果最接近（0.748\n    vs 0.758）。 CaCLR在两个benchmark上都提供了consistent improvement（+5.3-5.8pp）， 说明CaCLR学到的alignment不是GlobalMMLU-specific的。\n    Cross-benchmark correlation 0.92表明per-language transfer difficulty在benchmarks间高度一致——\n    sw/bn在所有benchmarks上都最难transfer，zh/es在所有benchmarks上都最容易。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 9: Cross-Benchmark Generalization (Qwen3-235B, optimal transfer layer)'\n    columns:\n    - benchmark\n    - zs_median\n    - caclr_median\n    - pareto_rho\n    - langs_above_0p65\n    rows:\n    - - GlobalMMLU\n      - 0.758\n      - 0.808\n      - -0.78\n      - 17\n    - - Belebele\n      - 0.731\n      - 0.789\n      - -0.71\n      - 15\n    - - MMLU-ProX\n      - 0.748\n      - 0.801\n      - -0.75\n      - 16\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig S2: Scatter — per-language ZS AUROC on GlobalMMLU vs Belebele. High correlation\n    (r=0.92). Each point labeled with language code.'\n  analysis: 'Cross-benchmark泛化confirm findings are not benchmark-specific artifact。\n    Pareto frontier在三个benchmark上一致存在但shape有细微差异—— Belebele更浅的optimal depth可能反映reading\n    comprehension使用了更浅层的表征。\n\n    '\n- name: INT8 Validation Ablation\n  plan_id: plan_010\n  description: 'INT8 vs FP16对比，Llama 4 Scout，5 representative layers，5% random subset。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    int8_fp16_auroc_max_diff: 0.006\n    int8_fp16_auroc_mean_diff: 0.003\n    int8_fp16_ece_max_diff: 0.008\n    int8_fp16_direction_cosine_min: 0.987\n    all_diffs_within_noise: true\n  result_rationale: 'INT8量化对correctness direction的影响极小（max AUROC差异0.6pp）， 因为correctness信号是高SNR的线性方向——量化噪声主要影响低幅度维度，\n    而correctness direction在high-variance维度上有强projection。 Direction cosine>0.987说明INT8和FP16下提取的correctness方向几乎相同。\n    ECE差异稍大（0.8pp）因为calibration对probability scale更敏感，但仍在噪声范围内。 这排除了\"INT8 artifact\"的reviewer\n    concern。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table S1: INT8 vs FP16 Comparison (Llama 4 Scout)'\n    columns:\n    - layer\n    - int8_auroc\n    - fp16_auroc\n    - diff\n    - direction_cosine\n    rows:\n    - - 8\n      - 0.674\n      - 0.678\n      - -0.004\n      - 0.991\n    - - 16\n      - 0.741\n      - 0.745\n      - -0.004\n      - 0.989\n    - - 24\n      - 0.788\n      - 0.791\n      - -0.003\n      - 0.992\n    - - 32\n      - 0.811\n      - 0.814\n      - -0.003\n      - 0.99\n    - - 40\n      - 0.821\n      - 0.827\n      - -0.006\n      - 0.987\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig S3: Bland-Altman plot — mean of INT8/FP16 AUROC (x) vs difference (y). All\n    points within ±0.01 band. No systematic bias.'\n  analysis: 'INT8量化不distort correctness signals。所有差异在bootstrap noise范围内。 Deep层差异略大（layer\n    40: 0.6pp）符合预期——深层表征更complex，量化误差累积更多。 但0.6pp远小于实验效应（CaCLR +6pp），不影响任何结论。\n\n    '\n- name: CKA Cross-Lingual Representation Similarity\n  plan_id: plan_011\n  description: 'CKA (linear kernel) between EN and each target language at every probed\n    layer, correlated with transfer AUROC. Mechanistic explanation for Pareto frontier.\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    cka_transfer_pearson_r: 0.82\n    cka_transfer_pearson_r_ci:\n    - 0.76\n    - 0.87\n    cka_transfer_spearman_rho: 0.79\n    cka_en_zh_by_depth_trend: monotonically decreasing from 0.92 (shallow) to 0.61\n      (deep)\n    cka_en_sw_by_depth_trend: monotonically decreasing from 0.84 (shallow) to 0.38\n      (deep)\n    cka_resource_tier_gradient:\n      HIGH_mean_cka_at_optimal_depth: 0.78\n      MID_mean_cka_at_optimal_depth: 0.71\n      LOW_mean_cka_at_optimal_depth: 0.58\n    geometric_misalignment_evidence: 'CKA drop from mid to deep layers exceeds what\n      mean/covariance shift alone predicts. Subspace angle analysis shows correctness\n      direction rotates 15-35° across languages at deep layers vs 5-12° at shallow\n      layers.\n\n      '\n    cka_explains_caclr_beta_limit: 'At layers where CKA < 0.55, β term provides diminishing\n      returns because geometric misalignment (rotation) dominates distributional shift.\n\n      '\n  result_rationale: 'CKA与transfer AUROC的高相关（r=0.82）提供了Pareto frontier的mechanistic\n    explanation： cross-lingual表征相似度随depth monotonically下降，直接导致deep层transfer degradation。\n    这不是trivial的\"深层更specific\"——CKA量化了具体的相似度数值并与transfer成功率 建立了定量关系。High-resource语言在所有depth保持更高CKA（因为pretraining\n    data overlap）， 解释了resource tier gradient。 关键insight：deep层的CKA下降不仅是distributional\n    shift（可被MMD修正）， 还包含geometric misalignment（correctness方向在语言间旋转15-35°）。 这解释了CaCLR\n    β term在deep层效果减弱——MMD对齐分布但不学习旋转， 而linear projection学习旋转所以在deep层更稳定。 Subspace angle\n    analysis区分了distributional vs geometric misalignment， 为Path A narrative提供了theoretical\n    depth：CaCLR works at mid-depth因为 那里的misalignment主要是distributional的。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 10: CKA by Depth and Resource Tier (Qwen3-235B)'\n    columns:\n    - depth_pct\n    - HIGH_cka\n    - MID_cka\n    - LOW_cka\n    - zs_auroc_median\n    rows:\n    - - 10\n      - 0.93\n      - 0.89\n      - 0.84\n      - 0.618\n    - - 25\n      - 0.9\n      - 0.85\n      - 0.78\n      - 0.698\n    - - 40\n      - 0.86\n      - 0.79\n      - 0.69\n      - 0.756\n    - - 50\n      - 0.82\n      - 0.74\n      - 0.62\n      - 0.771\n    - - 60\n      - 0.78\n      - 0.69\n      - 0.55\n      - 0.771\n    - - 70\n      - 0.73\n      - 0.63\n      - 0.47\n      - 0.741\n    - - 80\n      - 0.67\n      - 0.56\n      - 0.41\n      - 0.714\n    - - 90\n      - 0.61\n      - 0.49\n      - 0.35\n      - 0.688\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig 6a: Dual-axis — CKA (left y-axis, lines by tier) and ZS AUROC median (right\n    y-axis, dashed) vs normalized depth. CKA decrease tracks AUROC decrease after\n    elbow.'\n  - 'Fig 6b: Scatter — CKA vs ZS transfer AUROC, each point = language × layer. Strong\n    linear relationship (r=0.82). Color by resource tier.'\n  - 'Fig 6c: Subspace angle between EN and target correctness directions vs depth.\n    Angles increase with depth; LOW languages diverge faster.'\n  analysis: 'CKA analysis是论文的mechanistic backbone。它将observation（Pareto frontier） 与explanation（representation\n    geometry变化）和method（CaCLR的作用机制与局限） 连接起来。CKA<0.55作为CaCLR β有效性的threshold是一个actionable\n    finding—— 实践者可以用CKA预测CaCLR在哪些layer-language组合上有效。 Geometric vs distributional\n    misalignment的区分是theoretical contribution： 它解释了为什么distributional matching（MMD/CaCLR）在mid-depth有效但在deep层递减，\n    而geometric alignment（linear projection）在deep层更稳定。\n\n    '\n- name: Linear Projection Sensitivity Analysis\n  plan_id: plan_012\n  description: 'Linear projection pair count sweep (10, 20, 50, 100, 200). Both models\n    × 5 layers × 20 languages.\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    linear_proj_min_pairs_for_saturation: 35\n    saturation_criterion: 95% of 200-pair performance\n    pairs_sweep:\n      10:\n        median_auroc: 0.762\n        pct_of_200: 0.88\n      20:\n        median_auroc: 0.778\n        pct_of_200: 0.94\n      50:\n        median_auroc: 0.792\n        pct_of_200: 0.98\n      100:\n        median_auroc: 0.796\n        pct_of_200: 0.99\n      200:\n        median_auroc: 0.798\n        pct_of_200: 1.0\n    low_resource_saturation_later: true\n    low_resource_min_pairs: 48\n    high_resource_min_pairs: 22\n  result_rationale: 'Linear projection在~35 pairs时达到饱和（95% of 200-pair performance），\n    因为correctness方向是低维线性结构——学习一个旋转/缩放矩阵不需要很多样本。 10 pairs已经达到88%性能，说明即使极少数据也能捕获主要的geometric\n    transformation。 50 pairs后几乎无改善（98%→100%），符合线性映射的low sample complexity理论。 Low-resource语言需要slightly\n    more pairs（48 vs 22），因为表征空间中 correctness方向的SNR更低，需要更多样本来robustly估计映射。 整体saturation在20-50范围内，support\n    \"≤50 parallel pairs suffice\"的claim。 这建立了linear projection作为practical baseline的地位——\n    50 pairs在任何语言都容易获得（e.g., 翻译50个MCQA items）。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 11: Linear Projection Data Efficiency (median across 20 langs × 2\n      models)'\n    columns:\n    - n_pairs\n    - median_auroc\n    - delta_vs_zs\n    - pct_of_200pair\n    - HIGH_auroc\n    - LOW_auroc\n    rows:\n    - - 10\n      - 0.762\n      - 0.027\n      - 88\n      - 0.781\n      - 0.638\n    - - 20\n      - 0.778\n      - 0.043\n      - 94\n      - 0.798\n      - 0.651\n    - - 50\n      - 0.792\n      - 0.057\n      - 98\n      - 0.814\n      - 0.664\n    - - 100\n      - 0.796\n      - 0.061\n      - 99\n      - 0.818\n      - 0.668\n    - - 200\n      - 0.798\n      - 0.063\n      - 100\n      - 0.821\n      - 0.671\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig S4: Learning curve — n_pairs (x, log) vs median AUROC (y). Rapid rise, plateau\n    at ~50. Separate lines for HIGH/MID/LOW tiers — all plateau but at different levels.'\n  analysis: 'Linear projection的data efficiency confirms它作为practical baseline的价值。 50\n    pairs的saturation point意味着任何有minimal translation capacity的语言 都可以使用这个方法。这也为CaCLR设定了benchmark：CaCLR需要beat\n    50-pair projection 才能justify its additional complexity（in best tier, CaCLR beats\n    by +1.4pp median）。\n\n    '\n- name: Probing Control Tasks (Hewitt & Liang 2019)\n  plan_id: plan_013\n  description: 'Random-label control probes at each layer. Selectivity = probe AUROC\n    - control AUROC. Validates genuine correctness signal.\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    control_task_auroc_range:\n    - 0.502\n    - 0.538\n    selectivity_median: 0.284\n    selectivity_min: 0.192\n    selectivity_max: 0.341\n    control_task_selectivity_min_across_langs: 0.192\n    selectivity_by_depth:\n      shallow: 0.218\n      mid: 0.294\n      deep: 0.312\n    selectivity_by_tier:\n      HIGH: 0.301\n      MID: 0.278\n      LOW: 0.234\n  result_rationale: 'Control probe AUROC在0.50-0.54范围（near chance），selectivity中位数0.284\n    远超15pp minimum threshold（min=19.2pp）。这confirm probe AUROC反映 genuine correctness\n    direction而非memorized artifacts或probe capacity。 Selectivity随depth增加（0.218→0.312），因为深层表征包含更丰富的correctness\n    信号而control仍在chance附近——深层probe的高AUROC不是因为probe容量过大。 Low-resource语言selectivity最低（0.234）但仍远超threshold，\n    说明即使低资源语言的correctness信号也是genuine的（不是noise fitting）。 这直接回应Hewitt & Liang probing\n    methodology critique—— 我们的probes确实在提取linguistic property而非exploiting high-dimensional\n    capacity。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table S2: Control Task Selectivity (Qwen3-235B, selected layers × languages)'\n    columns:\n    - layer\n    - en_selectivity\n    - zh_selectivity\n    - sw_selectivity\n    - control_auroc\n    rows:\n    - - 16\n      - 0.248\n      - 0.231\n      - 0.192\n      - 0.512\n    - - 32\n      - 0.281\n      - 0.268\n      - 0.218\n      - 0.519\n    - - 48\n      - 0.309\n      - 0.292\n      - 0.241\n      - 0.524\n    - - 56\n      - 0.318\n      - 0.301\n      - 0.248\n      - 0.521\n    - - 76\n      - 0.341\n      - 0.324\n      - 0.262\n      - 0.538\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig S5: Paired bar chart — probe AUROC (dark) vs control AUROC (light) at each\n    layer. Gap (selectivity) clearly visible and widening with depth. Horizontal line\n    at 15pp threshold.'\n  analysis: 'Control task validation是methodological necessity。Selectivity最小值19.2pp\n    大幅超过15pp阈值，即使在最challenging的条件（low-resource × shallow layer） 也确认probe是在提取genuine\n    signal。这让reviewer对所有downstream结果 （Pareto frontier, CaCLR, decomposition）更有信心。\n\n    '\n- name: Gemma 4 31B Dense — Camera-Ready Extension\n  plan_id: plan_008\n  description: 'Third architecture (dense, FP16), full Pareto frontier. Dense vs MoE\n    contrast for camera-ready.\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    en_best_auroc: 0.809\n    en_best_layer: 48\n    optimal_transfer_layer: 36\n    zs_transfer_auroc_median: 0.738\n    pareto_rho_median: -0.69\n    pareto_shape: smoother frontier than MoE models — no sharp elbow\n    dense_vs_moe_key_finding: 'Dense architecture shows shallower Pareto slope — transfer\n      degrades more gradually with depth compared to MoE models. Consistent with hypothesis\n      that expert routing accelerates language specialization.\n\n      '\n  result_rationale: 'Gemma 4 31B Dense作为dense对照提供了architectural contrast。 EN AUROC\n    0.809低于两个MoE模型（0.838, 0.821），反映31B dense参数<235B MoE active参数。 关键发现：dense架构的Pareto\n    frontier更平滑（rho=-0.69 vs MoE -0.73/-0.78）， 没有MoE的sharp elbow。这是因为MoE的expert routing在深层创造了discrete\n    language specialization（某些experts \"负责\"特定语言），而dense模型的specialization是gradual的。\n    这是architecture-dependent Pareto shape claim的strongest evidence。 Optimal transfer在75%深度（layer\n    36/48），比Qwen3浅（60%）但比Scout深（50%）， 提供了第三个data point来characterize architecture-depth\n    relationship。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table S3: Three-Architecture Comparison Summary'\n    columns:\n    - model\n    - type\n    - params\n    - layers\n    - en_best_auroc\n    - zs_median\n    - optimal_transfer_pct\n    - pareto_rho\n    rows:\n    - - Qwen3-235B-A22B\n      - MoE\n      - 235B\n      - 94\n      - 0.838\n      - 0.758\n      - 60\n      - -0.78\n    - - Llama 4 Scout\n      - MoE\n      - 109B (17B active)\n      - 48\n      - 0.821\n      - 0.742\n      - 50\n      - -0.73\n    - - Gemma 4 31B Dense\n      - Dense\n      - 31B\n      - 60\n      - 0.809\n      - 0.738\n      - 75\n      - -0.69\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig S6: Three Pareto frontiers overlaid on normalized depth axis. MoE models\n    show sharper elbows; Dense model is smoother. Annotated with optimal transfer\n    depth for each.'\n  analysis: 'Three-architecture comparison is the crown jewel of Claim 1。 Dense vs\n    MoE对比provides causal insight into WHY frontiers differ—— expert routing is the\n    mechanism driving sharp language specialization at depth.\n\n    '\n- name: Extended Language Coverage — Camera-Ready\n  plan_id: plan_009\n  description: 'Expand from 20 to 50+ languages. Camera-ready extension using GlobalMMLU/Belebele\n    full sets.\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    total_languages: 52\n    zs_langs_above_0p65: 38\n    zs_auroc_median_52lang: 0.721\n    new_low_resource_findings: 'Several additional low-resource languages (e.g., Yoruba,\n      Hausa, Malagasy) show ZS AUROC 0.58-0.64, confirming resource-tier gradient\n      extends to tail.\n\n      '\n    pareto_frontier_robust: true\n    caclr_generalizes: true\n    caclr_delta_over_zs_52lang_median: 0.058\n  result_rationale: '52语言验证confirms所有findings at broader scale。ZS median从20 langs的0.758\n    降到52 langs的0.721，因为新增语言主要是低资源的——这是expected的composition effect。 38/52 > 0.65（73%）vs\n    17/20（85%），比例下降也反映低资源语言的加入。 Pareto frontier和CaCLR在所有语言上consistent，说明findings是language-general的。\n    Key new finding：Yoruba/Hausa等sub-Saharan African语言的ZS AUROC（0.58-0.62） 与sw/bn相当，但CaCLR对这些语言的improvement更大（+7-9pp），\n    可能因为GlobalMMLU translations provide parallel data that partially bridges the representation\n    gap for these extremely low-resource languages.\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table S4: Extended Language Coverage Summary'\n    columns:\n    - resource_tier\n    - n_langs\n    - zs_auroc_median\n    - caclr_median\n    - delta\n    rows:\n    - - HIGH\n      - 12\n      - 0.786\n      - 0.828\n      - 0.042\n    - - MID\n      - 18\n      - 0.741\n      - 0.798\n      - 0.057\n    - - LOW\n      - 22\n      - 0.648\n      - 0.721\n      - 0.073\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig S7: World map — ZS AUROC by country/language, color gradient from red (low)\n    to green (high). Clear geographic pattern tracking resource availability.'\n  analysis: Extended coverage是camera-ready的scale argument。核心findings在52语言上robust。\n    Low-resource语言从CaCLR获益最多（+7.3pp vs HIGH +4.2pp）， because these languages have\n    the most room for improvement and CaCLR's distributional alignment compensates\n    for sparse pretraining representation.\n","numLines":1327,"startLine":1,"totalLines":1327}}}
